#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Generic complex-number arithmetic for LunaFlow, with analytic and transcendental functions for complex doubles."
msgstr "LunaFlow 的泛型复数运算库，并为双精度复数提供解析函数与超越函数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:3
#: manual/api/float_backend.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "作用"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "The root package `Luna-Flow/luna-complex` defines `Complex[T]`, the complex numbers $a + bi$ over any scalar type `T`, with construction, in-place mutation, conjugation, the arithmetic operators and the `luna-generic` structure traits. It contains no analytic functions; those are in [`float_backend`](float_backend.md). The algebra behind the instances is in the [core design](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "根包 `Luna-Flow/luna-complex` 定义了 `Complex[T]`，即任意标量类型 `T` 上的复数 $a + bi$，并提供构造、原地修改、共轭、算术运算符以及 `luna-generic` 结构 trait。它不包含解析函数；这些函数位于 [`float_backend`](float_backend.md)。这些实例背后的代数原理见[核心设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:12
msgid "Source: [`src/complex.mbt`](../../../src/complex.mbt), [`src/complex_traits.mbt`](../../../src/complex_traits.mbt) and [`src/extends.mbt`](../../../src/extends.mbt)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/complex.mbt`](../../../src/complex.mbt)、[`src/complex_traits.mbt`](../../../src/complex_traits.mbt) 和 [`src/extends.mbt`](../../../src/extends.mbt)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:16
#: manual/api/float_backend.md:16
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/core.md:24
msgid "The examples use the alias `@complex`."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@complex`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:26
msgid "The type"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/core.md:30
msgid "A complex number with a real part `re` and an imaginary part `im`."
msgstr "具有实部 `re` 和虚部 `im` 的复数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:39
msgid "The value is $\\texttt{re} + \\texttt{im}\\,i$ with $i^2 = -1$. Both fields are public and mutable, and the struct is `pub(all)`, so code outside the package can read, write and construct it with a record literal. `Complex[T]` is a reference type: two bindings to the same value see each other's updates."
msgstr "其值为 $\\texttt{re} + \\texttt{im}\\,i$，其中 $i^2 = -1$。两个字段都是公开且可变的，且该结构体为 `pub(all)`，因此包外代码可以读取、写入它，并用记录字面量构造它。`Complex[T]` 是引用类型：绑定到同一个值的两个变量能看到彼此的修改。"

#: manual/api/core.md:45
msgid "`derive(Eq)` compares both parts with `T`'s equality (for `Double`, `0.0 == -0.0` and NaN is unequal to itself). `derive(Debug)` prints the record form `{ re: …, im: … }`."
msgstr "`derive(Eq)` 使用 `T` 的相等性比较两个部分（对于 `Double`，`0.0 == -0.0`，且 NaN 不等于自身）。`derive(Debug)` 打印记录形式 `{ re: …, im: … }`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:49
msgid "Construction and mutation"
msgstr "构造与修改"

#: manual/api/core.md:53
msgid "Builds $re + im\\,i$."
msgstr "构造 $re + im\\,i$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:61
msgid "Overwrites both parts in place."
msgstr "原地覆盖两个部分。"

#: manual/api/core.md:69
msgid "Overwrites the real part in place."
msgstr "原地覆盖实部。"

#: manual/api/core.md:77
msgid "Overwrites the imaginary part in place."
msgstr "原地覆盖虚部。"

#: manual/api/core.md:93
msgid "Identities"
msgstr "单位元"

#: manual/api/core.md:97
msgid "Returns $0 + 0i$."
msgstr "返回 $0 + 0i$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:105
msgid "Returns $1 + 0i$."
msgstr "返回 $1 + 0i$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:111
msgid "Both are the promoted methods of the `Zero` and `One` instances."
msgstr "两者分别是 `Zero` 和 `One` 实例的提升方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:113
msgid "Arithmetic"
msgstr "算术"

#: manual/api/core.md:115
msgid "Each operator is available as an operator and as a promoted method."
msgstr "每种运算既可作为运算符使用，也可作为提升方法使用。"

#: manual/api/core.md:117
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: manual/api/core.md:117
msgid "Operator"
msgstr "运算符"

#: manual/api/core.md:117
#: manual/api/core.md:176
#: manual/api/float_backend.md:278
#: manual/api/float_backend.md:437
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/core.md:117
#: manual/api/core.md:267
msgid "Bound on `T`"
msgstr "对 `T` 的约束"

#: manual/api/core.md:125
msgid "Here $z = a + bi$ and $w = c + di$."
msgstr "此处 $z = a + bi$，$w = c + di$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:129
msgid "Adds componentwise."
msgstr "逐分量相加。"

#: manual/api/core.md:138
msgid "Subtracts componentwise."
msgstr "逐分量相减。"

#: manual/api/core.md:147
msgid "Negates both parts."
msgstr "对两个部分取负。"

#: manual/api/core.md:156
msgid "Multiplies with $i^2 = -1$, using four multiplications."
msgstr "按 $i^2 = -1$ 相乘，使用四次乘法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:165
msgid "Divides by multiplying with the inverse of the squared modulus."
msgstr "通过乘以模平方的倒数来做除法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:172
msgid "It computes $n = c^2 + d^2$, then `Inverse::inv(n)`, and multiplies both parts of $z\\bar w$ by it. The formula is not scaled, so for `Double` the result depends on the size of $|w|$:"
msgstr "它先计算 $n = c^2 + d^2$，再计算 `Inverse::inv(n)`，然后用它乘 $z\\bar w$ 的两个分量。该公式没有缩放，因此对 `Double` 而言，结果取决于 $|w|$ 的大小："

#: manual/api/core.md:176
msgid "$\\lvert w\\rvert$ (about)"
msgstr "$\\lvert w\\rvert$（约）"

#: manual/api/core.md:178
msgid "above $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$"
msgstr "大于 $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$"

#: manual/api/core.md:178
msgid "overflows to $\\infty$"
msgstr "上溢为 $\\infty$"

#: manual/api/core.md:178
msgid "$n^{-1} = 0$: zero parts, or NaN where a part of $z\\bar w$ is also infinite"
msgstr "$n^{-1} = 0$：分量为零；若 $z\\bar w$ 的某个分量也是无穷大，则为 NaN"

#: manual/api/core.md:179
msgid "$10^{-154}$ to $10^{154}$"
msgstr "$10^{-154}$ 到 $10^{154}$"

#: manual/api/core.md:179
msgid "in range"
msgstr "在范围内"

#: manual/api/core.md:179
msgid "the quotient, up to rounding"
msgstr "商，误差在舍入范围内"

#: manual/api/core.md:180
msgid "$1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ to $10^{-154}$"
msgstr "$1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 到 $10^{-154}$"

#: manual/api/core.md:180
msgid "subnormal"
msgstr "次正规数"

#: manual/api/core.md:180
msgid "inaccurate; below about $7.5 \\times 10^{-155}$, $n^{-1}$ overflows and the parts become $\\pm\\infty$ or NaN"
msgstr "不精确；低于约 $7.5 \\times 10^{-155}$ 时 $n^{-1}$ 上溢，分量变为 $\\pm\\infty$ 或 NaN"

#: manual/api/core.md:181
msgid "below $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$, or $w = 0$"
msgstr "低于 $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$，或 $w = 0$"

#: manual/api/core.md:181
msgid "**aborts**"
msgstr "**中止**"

#: manual/api/core.md:183
msgid "The abort comes from `Inverse::inv` of `Double` in `luna-generic`, which rejects zero. For example `Complex::new(1e200, 0.0) / Complex::new(1e200, 0.0)` is NaN $+ 0i$, and dividing by $10^{-170}$ aborts. Use [`@fb.div`](float_backend.md#div) for robust floating-point division."
msgstr "中止来自 `luna-generic` 中 `Double` 的 `Inverse::inv`，它拒绝零。例如 `Complex::new(1e200, 0.0) / Complex::new(1e200, 0.0)` 为 NaN $+ 0i$，而除以 $10^{-170}$ 会中止。稳健的浮点除法请使用 [`@fb.div`](float_backend.md#div)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:200
msgid "Conjugate and inverse"
msgstr "共轭与逆"

#: manual/api/core.md:204
msgid "Returns $\\bar z = a - bi$."
msgstr "返回 $\\bar z = a - bi$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:213
msgid "Returns $z^{-1} = \\bar z / (a^2 + b^2)$."
msgstr "返回 $z^{-1} = \\bar z / (a^2 + b^2)$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:220
msgid "It has the same unscaled formula, the same size ranges and the same abort on a zero or underflowed modulus as `Complex::div`: `inv` of $10^{-160}$ is $\\infty + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$, and `inv` of $10^{-170}$ aborts."
msgstr "它采用与 `Complex::div` 相同的未缩放公式、相同的大小范围，在模为零或下溢时同样会中止：$10^{-160}$ 的 `inv` 为 $\\infty + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$，$10^{-170}$ 的 `inv` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/core.md:233
msgid "Equality and text"
msgstr "相等性与文本"

#: manual/api/core.md:237
msgid "Compares both parts; the promoted method of the derived `Eq`. Prefer `==`."
msgstr "比较两个部分；是派生的 `Eq` 的提升方法。建议使用 `==`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:245
msgid "Formats $z$ as `\"<re> + <im>i\"` using `T`'s `Show`."
msgstr "使用 `T` 的 `Show` 将 $z$ 格式化为 `\"<re> + <im>i\"`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:252
msgid "The sign of the imaginary part is printed by `T`, so $1 - 2i$ prints as `1 + -2i`. String interpolation `\"\\{z}\"` uses the same text."
msgstr "虚部的符号由 `T` 打印，因此 $1 - 2i$ 打印为 `1 + -2i`。字符串插值 `\"\\{z}\"` 使用相同的文本。"

#: manual/api/core.md:262
msgid "Structure instances"
msgstr "结构实例"

#: manual/api/core.md:264
msgid "`Complex[T]` implements the `luna-generic` structure traits under the bounds below. The [core design](../design/core.md) derives each law."
msgstr "`Complex[T]` 在下列约束下实现了 `luna-generic` 的结构 trait。[核心设计](../design/core.md)推导了每条定律。"

#: manual/api/core.md:267
msgid "Instance"
msgstr "实例"

#: manual/api/core.md:281
msgid "[!WARNING] `Complex[T]` is a field only when $-1$ is not a square in `T`. That holds for the real-number types `Float` and `Double`, but not for `Complex[Double]`: in `Complex[Complex[Double]]` the non-zero value $1 + i\\,j$ (with $i$ the inner and $j$ the outer unit) has squared modulus $1 + i^2 = 0$, so `inv` aborts. The `Field` instance is still provided for every `T : Field`; see the [core design](../design/core.md#when-the-construction-is-a-field)."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 仅当 $-1$ 在 `T` 中不是平方数时，`Complex[T]` 才是域。实数类型 `Float` 和 `Double` 满足这一点，但 `Complex[Double]` 不满足：在 `Complex[Complex[Double]]` 中，非零值 $1 + i\\,j$（$i$ 为内层单位、$j$ 为外层单位）的模平方为 $1 + i^2 = 0$，因此 `inv` 会中止。对每个 `T : Field` 仍然提供了 `Field` 实例；参见[核心设计](../design/core.md#when-the-construction-is-a-field)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:289
msgid ""
"For `T = Double` the laws hold only up to rounding, and the field law $z z^{-1} = 1$ for $z \\n"
"e 0$ fails outside the range of the table under `Complex::div`: `inv` aborts for non-zero $|z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ and returns $0$ for $|z| > 1.3 \\times 10^{154}$. The [core design](../design/core.md#floating-point-instances) derives these limits."
msgstr ""
"对于 `T = Double`，各定律只在舍入意义下成立，并且对 $z \\n"
"e 0$ 的域定律 $z z^{-1} = 1$ 在 `Complex::div` 下表格给出的范围之外不成立：非零的 $|z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时 `inv` 中止，$|z| > 1.3 \\times 10^{154}$ 时返回 $0$。[核心设计](../design/core.md#floating-point-instances)推导了这些界限。"

