#: manual/api/float_backend.md:1
msgid "float_backend API"
msgstr "float_backend API"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:5
msgid "The `float_backend` package provides the analytic functions of `Complex[Double]`: modulus and argument, division, roots, exponentials and logarithms, powers, and the trigonometric and hyperbolic functions with their inverses. It also defines three capability traits for floating-point scalars, implemented for `Float` and `Double`. The derivations of the formulas and the branch cuts are in the [float_backend design](../design/float_backend.md)."
msgstr "`float_backend` 包提供 `Complex[Double]` 的解析函数：模与辐角、除法、开方、指数与对数、幂，以及三角函数、双曲函数及其反函数。它还为浮点标量定义了三个能力 trait，并为 `Float` 和 `Double` 实现了它们。公式与分支切割线的推导见 [float_backend 设计](../design/float_backend.md)。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:12
msgid "Source: [`src/float_backend/`](../../../src/float_backend/float_backend_traits.mbt) (`float_backend_traits.mbt`, `complex_elementary.mbt`, `complex_trigonometric.mbt`, `complex_hyperbolic.mbt`)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/float_backend/`](../../../src/float_backend/float_backend_traits.mbt)（`float_backend_traits.mbt`、`complex_elementary.mbt`、`complex_trigonometric.mbt`、`complex_hyperbolic.mbt`）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:24
msgid "The examples use `@fb` for this package and `@complex` for the root package. All functions are free functions over `Complex[Double]` (MoonBit does not let a package add methods to a type of another package)."
msgstr "示例中用 `@fb` 表示本包，用 `@complex` 表示根包。所有函数都是作用于 `Complex[Double]` 的自由函数（MoonBit 不允许一个包为另一个包的类型添加方法）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:28
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr "约定"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:30
msgid "**Principal values.** Multi-valued functions return one value of a fixed branch, described per function. `arg` returns values in $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ except on the negative real axis (see the warning below)."
msgstr "**主值。** 多值函数返回某个固定分支上的一个值，各函数分别说明。`arg` 返回 $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ 内的值，负实轴上除外（见下方警告）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:33
msgid "**Special values.** NaN and infinities are handled where stated (`div`, `atan`, `atanh`, `acosh`, `abs_log`, `pow`); elsewhere they propagate through ordinary `Double` arithmetic and may produce NaN parts. In particular `exp`, `sin`, `cos`, `sinh` and `cosh` form products such as $e^{x}\\sin y$ or $\\cosh x \\sin y$, so a factor that overflows times a factor that is exactly zero gives NaN: `exp(710 + 0i)`, `cosh(800 + 0i)` and `sinh(800 + 0i)` have a NaN imaginary part, `sin(800i)` a NaN real part."
msgstr "**特殊值。** NaN 和无穷大只在注明之处（`div`、`atan`、`atanh`、`acosh`、`abs_log`、`pow`）专门处理；其余情况下它们按普通 `Double` 算术传播，可能产生 NaN 分量。特别地，`exp`、`sin`、`cos`、`sinh` 和 `cosh` 会计算 $e^{x}\\sin y$ 或 $\\cosh x \\sin y$ 这样的乘积，因此一个上溢的因子乘以一个恰好为零的因子会得到 NaN：`exp(710 + 0i)`、`cosh(800 + 0i)` 和 `sinh(800 + 0i)` 的虚部为 NaN，`sin(800i)` 的实部为 NaN。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:41
msgid "**Signed zeros are ignored.** Functions test `y == 0.0` and `x == 0.0`, which do not distinguish $+0$ from $-0$, so both sides of a branch cut that runs along an axis get the same value. The [design](../design/float_backend.md#values-on-the-branch-cuts) lists which side each function takes."
msgstr "**忽略零的符号。** 函数用 `y == 0.0` 和 `x == 0.0` 做判断，这不区分 $+0$ 与 $-0$，因此沿坐标轴的分支切割线两侧得到相同的值。[设计文档](../design/float_backend.md#values-on-the-branch-cuts)列出了每个函数取哪一侧。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:46
msgid "**Reciprocal functions go through `Complex::inv`.** `sec`, `csc`, `cot`, `sech`, `csch`, `coth`, `asec`, `acsc`, `asech`, `acsch`, `acoth` and the negative integer exponents of `pow` and `pow_real` use the unscaled [`Complex::inv`](core.md#complexinv) of the core. It aborts when the modulus of its argument is $0$ or below about $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$, and returns infinite or NaN parts for moduli below about $10^{-154}$ or above about $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$. So `csc(0)`, `csc(1e-170)` and `pow_real(1e-200 + 0i, -2.0)` abort, `csc(1e-160)` is $\\infty + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$, and `csc(800i)` is NaN $+$ NaN$i$. A true pole such as $\\pi/2$ for `sec` is not hit exactly, because `cos(@math.PI / 2.0)` is about $6 \\times 10^{-17}$, not $0$; `sec` returns about $1.6 \\times 10^{16}$ there."
msgstr "**倒数类函数经由 `Complex::inv`。** `sec`、`csc`、`cot`、`sech`、`csch`、`coth`、`asec`、`acsc`、`asech`、`acsch`、`acoth` 以及 `pow` 和 `pow_real` 的负整数指数都使用核心包中未缩放的 [`Complex::inv`](core.md#complexinv)。当其参数的模为 $0$ 或低于约 $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时它会中止，模低于约 $10^{-154}$ 或高于约 $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$ 时返回无穷或 NaN 分量。因此 `csc(0)`、`csc(1e-170)` 和 `pow_real(1e-200 + 0i, -2.0)` 会中止，`csc(1e-160)` 为 $\\infty + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$，`csc(800i)` 为 NaN $+$ NaN$i$。像 `sec` 在 $\\pi/2$ 处这样的真正极点不会被精确命中，因为 `cos(@math.PI / 2.0)` 约为 $6 \\times 10^{-17}$ 而不是 $0$；`sec` 在那里返回约 $1.6 \\times 10^{16}$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:59
msgid "[!WARNING] Several functions return an angle exactly $\\pi$ larger than the principal value, because the code uses $2\\pi$ where the principal value has $\\pi$: `arg` on the negative real axis ($2\\pi$ instead of $\\pi$, so `log(-1)` is $2\\pi i$ and `pow` of a negative real base uses that angle), the real part of `acos` for $\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ and of `acos_real` and `asec_real` for negative arguments, and the imaginary part of `acosh_real` for $x < -1$. For those inputs `cos(acos(z))` returns $-z$ and `cosh(acosh_real(x))` returns $-x$. The same holds for the functions built on them: `log_10`, `log_b`, `asec` for $\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$, and `acosh` and `asech` on the affected real inputs. In particular `exp(log(-1))` is $1$, and `pow_real(-4 + 0i, 0.5)` is $-2$ rather than $2i$. The values documented below are the values the code returns."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 有几个函数返回的角度恰好比主值大 $\\pi$，因为代码在主值应取 $\\pi$ 的地方使用了 $2\\pi$：负实轴上的 `arg`（得到 $2\\pi$ 而非 $\\pi$，因此 `log(-1)` 为 $2\\pi i$，负实数底数的 `pow` 也使用这一角度），$\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ 时 `acos` 的实部，负参数时 `acos_real` 与 `asec_real` 的实部，以及 $x < -1$ 时 `acosh_real` 的虚部。对这些输入，`cos(acos(z))` 返回 $-z$，`cosh(acosh_real(x))` 返回 $-x$。建立在它们之上的函数也是如此：`log_10`、`log_b`、$\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ 时的 `asec`，以及受影响实数输入上的 `acosh` 和 `asech`。特别地，`exp(log(-1))` 为 $1$，`pow_real(-4 + 0i, 0.5)` 为 $-2$ 而不是 $2i$。下文记录的是代码实际返回的值。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:73
msgid "Capability traits"
msgstr "能力 trait"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:77
msgid "The algebraic and analytic capabilities an analytic backend needs from its real scalar."
msgstr "解析后端对其实数标量所需的代数与解析能力。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:87
msgid "It has no methods of its own: it names the composition of `luna-generic` and `arithmetic` traits."
msgstr "它本身没有方法：它只是为 `luna-generic` 与 `arithmetic` trait 的组合命名。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:92
msgid "IEEE 754 special values and their tests."
msgstr "IEEE 754 特殊值及其判定。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:109
msgid "`is_negative_zero(x)` is `is_neg_inf(1.0 / x)`."
msgstr "`is_negative_zero(x)` 即 `is_neg_inf(1.0 / x)`。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:111
msgid "[!WARNING] `is_negative_zero` is also true for negative subnormal numbers close to zero, because $1/x$ overflows to $-\\infty$ there: for `Double` when $-5.6 \\times 10^{-309} < x < 0$ (for example `-1.0e-310`), for `Float` when $-2.9 \\times 10^{-39} < x < 0$. Test `x == 0.0` first when you need exactly $-0$; the package's own functions use a private helper that does."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 对于接近零的负次正规数，`is_negative_zero` 也为真，因为那里 $1/x$ 上溢为 $-\\infty$：对 `Double` 是 $-5.6 \\times 10^{-309} < x < 0$（例如 `-1.0e-310`），对 `Float` 是 $-2.9 \\times 10^{-39} < x < 0$。需要恰好判断 $-0$ 时，请先检查 `x == 0.0`；本包自己的函数使用一个这样做的私有辅助函数。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:120
msgid "The primitives the numerically stable algorithms use, on top of the two traits above."
msgstr "数值稳定算法在上述两个 trait 之上所用的基本操作。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:135
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:135
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:137
msgid "convert a `Double` constant"
msgstr "转换一个 `Double` 常量"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:137
msgid "identity"
msgstr "恒等"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:138
msgid "round towards zero"
msgstr "向零舍入"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:139
msgid "convert to `Int`"
msgstr "转换为 `Int`"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:140
msgid "$\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ without overflow"
msgstr "不会上溢的 $\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:143
msgid "The `Float` `log1p` is the direct formula, which loses relative accuracy for $|x| \\ll 1$ and returns $0$ for $|x|$ below about $6 \\times 10^{-8}$ (`log1p(1.0e-10)` is `0`). No public function of this package is generic over these traits yet; the `Complex[Double]` functions below call the `Double` primitives directly."
msgstr "`Float` 的 `log1p` 是直接公式，当 $|x| \\ll 1$ 时会损失相对精度，$|x|$ 低于约 $6 \\times 10^{-8}$ 时返回 $0$（`log1p(1.0e-10)` 为 `0`）。本包目前还没有对这些 trait 泛型的公开函数；下面的 `Complex[Double]` 函数直接调用 `Double` 的基本操作。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:173
msgid "Re-exported type"
msgstr "重新导出的类型"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:177
msgid "`@fb.Complex` is `@complex.Complex`; see the [core API](core.md)."
msgstr "`@fb.Complex` 就是 `@complex.Complex`；参见[核心 API](core.md)。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:183
msgid "Construction and storage"
msgstr "构造与存储"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:187
msgid "Builds $r e^{i\\theta} = r\\cos\\theta + i\\,r\\sin\\theta$."
msgstr "构造 $r e^{i\\theta} = r\\cos\\theta + i\\,r\\sin\\theta$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:193
msgid "No normalization is applied: a negative $r$ or any real $\\theta$ is accepted."
msgstr "不做规范化：接受负的 $r$ 和任意实数 $\\theta$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:198
msgid "Writes $z$ into an interleaved buffer `[re0, im0, re1, im1, …]` at complex index `offset`."
msgstr "将 $z$ 写入交错缓冲区 `[re0, im0, re1, im1, …]` 中复数下标为 `offset` 的位置。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:207
msgid "Writes a real and an imaginary part into an interleaved buffer."
msgstr "将实部和虚部写入交错缓冲区。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:213
msgid "The buffer length must be even. If `offset` equals the number of complex entries (`arr.length() / 2`), the pair is appended; otherwise it overwrites entry `offset`. An odd length aborts with `native_pack: buffer length must be even`, an offset outside `0..=arr.length() / 2` with `native_pack: offset out of bounds`."
msgstr "缓冲区长度必须为偶数。如果 `offset` 等于复数条目数（`arr.length() / 2`），则追加这一对值；否则覆盖第 `offset` 个条目。长度为奇数时以 `native_pack: buffer length must be even` 中止，偏移量超出 `0..=arr.length() / 2` 时以 `native_pack: offset out of bounds` 中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:231
msgid "Modulus and argument"
msgstr "模与辐角"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:235
msgid "Returns $|z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ with `hypot`, without intermediate overflow or underflow."
msgstr "用 `hypot` 返回 $|z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$，中间过程不会上溢或下溢。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:244
msgid "Returns $|z|^2$, computed as $m^2\\big((x/m)^2 + (y/m)^2\\big)$ with $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$."
msgstr "返回 $|z|^2$，按 $m^2\\big((x/m)^2 + (y/m)^2\\big)$ 计算，其中 $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:251
msgid "The scaling avoids spurious underflow of the squares; the result itself overflows to infinity when $|z|^2$ exceeds the `Double` range. $0$ maps to $0$."
msgstr "缩放避免了平方项的虚假下溢；当 $|z|^2$ 超出 `Double` 范围时，结果本身会上溢为无穷大。$0$ 映射为 $0$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:257
msgid "Returns $\\ln|z|$ as $\\ln m + \\tfrac12\\ln(1 + t^2)$ with $m = \\max(|x|,|y|)$ and $t = \\min/\\max$."
msgstr "按 $\\ln m + \\tfrac12\\ln(1 + t^2)$ 返回 $\\ln|z|$，其中 $m = \\max(|x|,|y|)$，$t = \\min/\\max$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:264
msgid "It is finite for every finite non-zero $z$, even when $|z|$ itself would overflow. `abs_log(0)` is $-\\infty$. The term $\\ln(1 + t^2)$ is evaluated directly, not with `log1p`, so the absolute error is small but the relative error is large when $|z|$ is close to $1$: `abs_log(1 + 1e-10i)` returns $0$ instead of $5 \\times 10^{-21}$, and so does the real part of `log` there."
msgstr "它对每个有限非零的 $z$ 都是有限的，即使 $|z|$ 本身会上溢。`abs_log(0)` 为 $-\\infty$。$\\ln(1 + t^2)$ 一项直接计算，没有用 `log1p`，因此绝对误差很小，但 $|z|$ 接近 $1$ 时相对误差很大：`abs_log(1 + 1e-10i)` 返回 $0$ 而不是 $5 \\times 10^{-21}$，那里 `log` 的实部也是如此。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:272
msgid "Returns the argument $\\theta$ with $z = |z| e^{i\\theta}$."
msgstr "返回满足 $z = |z| e^{i\\theta}$ 的辐角 $\\theta$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:278
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:280
msgid "$z = 0$ (either zero sign)"
msgstr "$z = 0$（任一零符号）"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:281
msgid "$2\\pi$ (see the warning above)"
msgstr "$2\\pi$（见上方警告）"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:282
#: manual/api/float_backend.md:445
msgid "otherwise"
msgstr "其他情况"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:298
msgid "Division"
msgstr "除法"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:302
msgid "Divides $z / w$ with Smith's scaling and IEEE special-value handling."
msgstr "使用 Smith 缩放和 IEEE 特殊值处理计算 $z / w$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:308
msgid "For finite $w$ it divides by the larger of $|c|, |d|$ first (with $r = d/c$ when $|c| \\ge |d|$):"
msgstr "对于有限的 $w$，它先除以 $|c|, |d|$ 中较大者（当 $|c| \\ge |d|$ 时取 $r = d/c$）："

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:315
msgid "so no square of $c$ or $d$ is formed. When $z$ has no NaN part and $w$ has an infinite part, the result is computed from the signs of the infinities: a finite $z$ gives $\\pm 0$ parts, an infinite $z$ gives the quotient of the sign patterns, so $\\infty / \\infty$ is $1$ (C99 gives NaN). Division by $0 + 0i$ returns NaN $+$ NaN$i$ (no abort)."
msgstr "因此不会形成 $c$ 或 $d$ 的平方。当 $z$ 没有 NaN 分量而 $w$ 有无穷分量时，结果由无穷大的符号算出：有限的 $z$ 得到 $\\pm 0$ 分量，无穷的 $z$ 得到符号模式之商，所以 $\\infty / \\infty$ 为 $1$（C99 给出 NaN）。除以 $0 + 0i$ 返回 NaN $+$ NaN$i$（不会中止）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:321
msgid "[!WARNING] `div` computes $1/c$ (or $1/d$) explicitly. When the larger part of $w$ is a subnormal number below about $5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$, $1/c$ overflows and the result is NaN $+$ NaN$i$ even when the quotient is finite: `div(1e-10 + 0i, 1e-310 + 0i)` is NaN instead of $10^{300}$."
msgstr "[!WARNING] `div` 显式计算 $1/c$（或 $1/d$）。当 $w$ 较大的分量是低于约 $5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$ 的次正规数时，$1/c$ 上溢，即使商是有限的，结果也是 NaN $+$ NaN$i$：`div(1e-10 + 0i, 1e-310 + 0i)` 为 NaN 而不是 $10^{300}$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:341
msgid "Roots"
msgstr "开方"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:345
msgid "Returns the principal square root: $\\operatorname{Re}\\sqrt z \\ge 0$, with the branch cut along the negative real axis."
msgstr "返回主平方根：$\\operatorname{Re}\\sqrt z \\ge 0$，分支切割线沿负实轴。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:352
msgid "It computes $w = \\sqrt{(|x| + |z|)/2}$ in a scaled form and returns $w + \\frac{y}{2w} i$ for $x \\ge 0$, and $\\frac{|y|}{2w} \\pm w\\,i$ for $x < 0$ with the sign of $y$. On the cut ($y = \\pm 0$, $x < 0$) the result is $+\\sqrt{|x|}\\,i$ for both zero signs. `sqrt(0)` is $0$."
msgstr "它以缩放形式计算 $w = \\sqrt{(|x| + |z|)/2}$，当 $x \\ge 0$ 时返回 $w + \\frac{y}{2w} i$，当 $x < 0$ 时返回 $\\frac{|y|}{2w} \\pm w\\,i$（符号与 $y$ 相同）。在割线上（$y = \\pm 0$，$x < 0$），对两种零符号结果都是 $+\\sqrt{|x|}\\,i$。`sqrt(0)` 为 $0$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:359
msgid "Square root of a real number as a complex number: $\\sqrt x$ for $x \\ge 0$, $i\\sqrt{-x}$ for $x < 0$."
msgstr "实数的平方根，以复数表示：$x \\ge 0$ 时为 $\\sqrt x$，$x < 0$ 时为 $i\\sqrt{-x}$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:374
msgid "Exponential and logarithms"
msgstr "指数与对数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:378
msgid "Returns $e^z = e^x(\\cos y + i\\sin y)$."
msgstr "返回 $e^z = e^x(\\cos y + i\\sin y)$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:384
msgid "$e^x$ is computed first, so it overflows for $x > 709.78$ even when a part of the result would be finite, and `exp(710 + 0i)` has a NaN imaginary part ($\\infty \\cdot 0$)."
msgstr "由于先计算 $e^x$，当 $x > 709.78$ 时它会上溢，即使结果的某个分量本应有限；并且 `exp(710 + 0i)` 的虚部为 NaN（$\\infty \\cdot 0$）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:390
msgid "Returns $\\ln|z| + i\\arg z$ with `abs_log` and `arg`."
msgstr "用 `abs_log` 和 `arg` 返回 $\\ln|z| + i\\arg z$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:396
msgid "The imaginary part follows `arg`, so it is $2\\pi$ on the negative real axis, and `exp(log(-1))` is $1$, not $-1$. `log(0)` is $-\\infty + 0i$."
msgstr "虚部遵循 `arg`，因此在负实轴上为 $2\\pi$，`exp(log(-1))` 为 $1$ 而不是 $-1$。`log(0)` 为 $-\\infty + 0i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:401
msgid "Returns $\\log_{10} z = \\log z / \\ln 10$."
msgstr "返回 $\\log_{10} z = \\log z / \\ln 10$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:409
msgid "Returns $\\log_b z = \\log z / \\log b$, divided with `div`."
msgstr "返回 $\\log_b z = \\log z / \\log b$，除法使用 `div`。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:425
msgid "Powers"
msgstr "幂"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:429
msgid "Returns $z^w$."
msgstr "返回 $z^w$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:435
msgid "The cases are tried in order:"
msgstr "依次尝试以下情形："

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:437
msgid "Case"
msgstr "情形"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:440
msgid "$z = 0$, $w$ real and positive"
msgstr "$z = 0$，$w$ 为正实数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:441
msgid "$z = 0$, otherwise"
msgstr "$z = 0$，其他情况"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:441
msgid "NaN + NaN$i$"
msgstr "NaN + NaN$i$"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:443
msgid "`z.inv()` (aborts for non-zero $\\lvert z\\rvert < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$)"
msgstr "`z.inv()`（非零 $\\lvert z\\rvert < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时中止）"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:444
msgid "$w$ real integer, $\\lvert w\\rvert  \\le 2^{31} - 1$"
msgstr "$w$ 为实整数，$\\lvert w\\rvert  \\le 2^{31} - 1$"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:444
msgid "binary powering; negative exponents invert $z$ first with `z.inv()`"
msgstr "二进制快速幂；负指数先用 `z.inv()` 对 $z$ 求逆"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:445
msgid "$e^{w\\log z}$ in polar form"
msgstr "极坐标形式的 $e^{w\\log z}$"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:447
msgid "The polar form computes $\\rho = e^{\\operatorname{Re} w \\ln|z| - \\operatorname{Im} w \\arg z}$ and $\\beta = \\operatorname{Re} w \\arg z + \\operatorname{Im} w \\ln|z|$ and returns $\\rho(\\cos\\beta + i\\sin\\beta)$. It uses `arg`, so a negative real base takes the angle $2\\pi$: `pow_real(-8 + 0i, 1.0 / 3.0)` is $-1 + 1.732i$ instead of the principal $1 + 1.732i$."
msgstr "极坐标形式先计算 $\\rho = e^{\\operatorname{Re} w \\ln|z| - \\operatorname{Im} w \\arg z}$ 与 $\\beta = \\operatorname{Re} w \\arg z + \\operatorname{Im} w \\ln|z|$，再返回 $\\rho(\\cos\\beta + i\\sin\\beta)$。它使用 `arg`，因此负实数底数取角度 $2\\pi$：`pow_real(-8 + 0i, 1.0 / 3.0)` 为 $-1 + 1.732i$，而不是主值 $1 + 1.732i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:455
msgid "Returns $z^p$ for a real exponent $p$, with the same zero, integer and polar cases as `pow`."
msgstr "对实指数 $p$ 返回 $z^p$，零、整数与极坐标情形与 `pow` 相同。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:472
msgid "Scalar operands"
msgstr "标量操作数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:476
msgid "Applies a binary complex function with a real second operand $x + 0i$."
msgstr "以实数 $x + 0i$ 作为第二个操作数应用二元复函数。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:484
msgid "Applies a binary complex function with an imaginary second operand $0 + yi$."
msgstr "以纯虚数 $0 + yi$ 作为第二个操作数应用二元复函数。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:499
msgid "Trigonometric functions"
msgstr "三角函数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:503
msgid "Returns $\\sin z = \\sin x\\cosh y + i\\cos x\\sinh y$; for $y = 0$ exactly, the real $\\sin x$."
msgstr "返回 $\\sin z = \\sin x\\cosh y + i\\cos x\\sinh y$；当 $y = 0$ 严格成立时，返回实数 $\\sin x$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:512
msgid "Returns $\\cos z = \\cos x\\cosh y - i\\sin x\\sinh y$; for $y = 0$ exactly, the real $\\cos x$."
msgstr "返回 $\\cos z = \\cos x\\cosh y - i\\sin x\\sinh y$；当 $y = 0$ 严格成立时，返回实数 $\\cos x$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:521
msgid "Returns $\\tan z$."
msgstr "返回 $\\tan z$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:527
msgid "For $|y| < 1$ it uses $\\dfrac{\\sin 2x + i\\sinh 2y}{2(\\cos^2 x + \\sinh^2 y)}$; for $|y| \\ge 1$ a form scaled by $e^{-2|y|}$ that tends to $\\pm i$ without overflow (see the design)."
msgstr "当 $|y| < 1$ 时使用 $\\dfrac{\\sin 2x + i\\sinh 2y}{2(\\cos^2 x + \\sinh^2 y)}$；当 $|y| \\ge 1$ 时使用以 $e^{-2|y|}$ 缩放的形式，它趋于 $\\pm i$ 而不会上溢（见设计文档）。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:533
msgid "Returns $1/\\cos z$ through `Complex::inv`; see the conventions for when it aborts."
msgstr "经由 `Complex::inv` 返回 $1/\\cos z$；何时中止见约定一节。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:542
msgid "Returns $1/\\sin z$; aborts at $z = 0$ and where $|\\sin z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$."
msgstr "返回 $1/\\sin z$；在 $z = 0$ 以及 $|\\sin z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:551
msgid "Returns $1/\\tan z$; aborts at $z = 0$ and where $|\\tan z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$."
msgstr "返回 $1/\\tan z$；在 $z = 0$ 以及 $|\\tan z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:570
msgid "Inverse trigonometric functions"
msgstr "反三角函数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:574
msgid "Returns the principal arcsine, with branch cuts on the real axis outside $[-1, 1]$; $\\operatorname{Re}$ lies in $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$."
msgstr "返回主值反正弦，分支切割线位于实轴上 $[-1, 1]$ 之外；$\\operatorname{Re}$ 位于 $[-\\pi/2, \\pi/2]$ 内。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:581
msgid "Real inputs go to `asin_real`, purely imaginary inputs to $i\\operatorname{asinh} y$, inputs with a part above $10^{150}$ to the asymptotic form $\\operatorname{atan2}(|x|, |y|) + i(\\ln 2 + \\ln|z|)$, and all others to the Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang algorithm (see the design). The result is odd in each part: the signs of $x$ and $y$ are copied to the real and imaginary parts. Close to the branch points $\\pm 1$ the imaginary part loses accuracy, because this branch evaluates $\\sqrt{A^2 - 1}$ instead of $\\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}$: at $1 + 10^{-10}i$ its relative error is about $4 \\times 10^{-8}$, while `acos` there is accurate."
msgstr "实数输入交给 `asin_real`，纯虚数输入转为 $i\\operatorname{asinh} y$，某一分量超过 $10^{150}$ 的输入使用渐近形式 $\\operatorname{atan2}(|x|, |y|) + i(\\ln 2 + \\ln|z|)$，其余输入使用 Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang 算法（见设计文档）。结果在每个分量上都是奇函数：$x$ 与 $y$ 的符号分别复制到实部和虚部。在分支点 $\\pm 1$ 附近虚部会损失精度，因为这一分支计算的是 $\\sqrt{A^2 - 1}$ 而不是 $\\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}$：在 $1 + 10^{-10}i$ 处其相对误差约为 $4 \\times 10^{-8}$，而 `acos` 在那里是精确的。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:593
msgid "Arcsine of a real number: $\\arcsin x$ for $|x| \\le 1$, $\\pm\\pi/2 + i\\operatorname{acosh}|x|$ for $|x| > 1$ (sign of $x$), NaN for NaN."
msgstr "实数的反正弦：$|x| \\le 1$ 时为 $\\arcsin x$，$|x| > 1$ 时为 $\\pm\\pi/2 + i\\operatorname{acosh}|x|$（符号同 $x$），NaN 时为 NaN。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:602
msgid "Returns the arccosine, with branch cuts on the real axis outside $[-1, 1]$."
msgstr "返回反余弦，分支切割线位于实轴上 $[-1, 1]$ 之外。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:608
msgid "For $x \\ge 0$ the real part is the principal value in $[0, \\pi/2]$ and the imaginary part has the sign opposite to $y$. For $x < 0$ the imaginary part is the principal one, but the real part is $2\\pi - \\rho$ instead of the principal $\\pi - \\rho$, where $\\rho \\in [0, \\pi/2]$ is the real part of $\\arccos(-z)$ (see the warning above). Purely imaginary inputs give $\\pi/2 - i\\operatorname{asinh} y$, and real inputs go to `acos_real`. Inputs with a part above $10^{150}$ use $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$ and get the principal value for every $x$, so the real part jumps by $\\pi$ at that threshold when $x < 0$."
msgstr "当 $x \\ge 0$ 时，实部是 $[0, \\pi/2]$ 内的主值，虚部符号与 $y$ 相反。当 $x < 0$ 时，虚部是主值，但实部为 $2\\pi - \\rho$ 而非主值 $\\pi - \\rho$，其中 $\\rho \\in [0, \\pi/2]$ 是 $\\arccos(-z)$ 的实部（见上方警告）。纯虚数输入得到 $\\pi/2 - i\\operatorname{asinh} y$，实数输入交给 `acos_real`。某一分量超过 $10^{150}$ 的输入使用 $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$，对任意 $x$ 都得到主值，因此当 $x < 0$ 时实部在该阈值处跳变 $\\pi$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:620
msgid "Arccosine of a real number: $\\arccos x$ for $|x| \\le 1$, $-i\\operatorname{acosh} x$ for $x > 1$, and $2\\pi - i\\operatorname{acosh}(-x)$ for $x < -1$."
msgstr "实数的反余弦：$|x| \\le 1$ 时为 $\\arccos x$，$x > 1$ 时为 $-i\\operatorname{acosh} x$，$x < -1$ 时为 $2\\pi - i\\operatorname{acosh}(-x)$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:629
msgid "Returns the principal arctangent, with branch cuts on the imaginary axis outside $[-i, i]$."
msgstr "返回主值反正切，分支切割线位于虚轴上 $[-i, i]$ 之外。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:636
msgid "The imaginary part is $\\tfrac14\\ln\\frac{x^2 + (1+y)^2}{x^2 + (1-y)^2}$, computed with `log1p` when the ratio is close to $1$; the real part is $\\tfrac12\\operatorname{atan2}(2x, 1 - x^2 - y^2)$, rescaled for large inputs. On the cut ($x = 0$, $|y| > 1$) the real part is $\\pm\\pi/2$ with the sign of $y$. Infinite inputs return $\\pm\\pi/2 + 0i$."
msgstr "虚部为 $\\tfrac14\\ln\\frac{x^2 + (1+y)^2}{x^2 + (1-y)^2}$，当比值接近 $1$ 时用 `log1p` 计算；实部为 $\\tfrac12\\operatorname{atan2}(2x, 1 - x^2 - y^2)$，对大输入会重新缩放。在割线上（$x = 0$，$|y| > 1$），实部为 $\\pm\\pi/2$，符号同 $y$。无穷输入返回 $\\pm\\pi/2 + 0i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:644
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$. It inherits the `acos` deviation wherever $\\operatorname{Re}(1/z) < 0$, that is for $\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ off the real interval $(-\\infty, -1]$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。凡是 $\\operatorname{Re}(1/z) < 0$ 之处，即实区间 $(-\\infty, -1]$ 之外 $\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ 的地方，它都继承 `acos` 的偏差。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:654
msgid "Arcsecant of a real number: $\\arccos(1/x)$ for $|x| \\ge 1$, $-i\\operatorname{acosh}(1/x)$ for $0 \\le x < 1$, $2\\pi - i\\operatorname{acosh}(-1/x)$ for $-1 < x < 0$. `asec_real(0)` is $0 - \\infty i$ (no abort, unlike `asec`). There is no NaN check: NaN falls into the last case and gives $2\\pi + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$."
msgstr "实数的反正割：$|x| \\ge 1$ 时为 $\\arccos(1/x)$，$0 \\le x < 1$ 时为 $-i\\operatorname{acosh}(1/x)$，$-1 < x < 0$ 时为 $2\\pi - i\\operatorname{acosh}(-1/x)$。`asec_real(0)` 为 $0 - \\infty i$（不会中止，这一点与 `asec` 不同）。它没有 NaN 检查：NaN 落入最后一种情况，得到 $2\\pi + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:666
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{asin}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{asin}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:674
msgid "Arccosecant of a real number: $\\arcsin(1/x)$ for $|x| \\ge 1$, $\\pm\\pi/2 + i\\operatorname{acosh}|1/x|$ for $|x| < 1$. `acsc_real(0)` is $\\pi/2 + \\infty i$ (no abort, unlike `acsc`); NaN gives $-\\pi/2 + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$."
msgstr "实数的反余割：$|x| \\ge 1$ 时为 $\\arcsin(1/x)$，$|x| < 1$ 时为 $\\pm\\pi/2 + i\\operatorname{acosh}|1/x|$。`acsc_real(0)` 为 $\\pi/2 + \\infty i$（不会中止，这一点与 `acsc` 不同）；NaN 得到 $-\\pi/2 + \\mathrm{NaN}\\,i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:685
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{atan}(1/z)$, and $\\pi/2$ at $z = 0$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{atan}(1/z)$，在 $z = 0$ 处返回 $\\pi/2$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:701
msgid "Hyperbolic functions"
msgstr "双曲函数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:705
msgid "Returns $\\sinh z = \\sinh x\\cos y + i\\cosh x\\sin y$."
msgstr "返回 $\\sinh z = \\sinh x\\cos y + i\\cosh x\\sin y$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:713
msgid "Returns $\\cosh z = \\cosh x\\cos y + i\\sinh x\\sin y$."
msgstr "返回 $\\cosh z = \\cosh x\\cos y + i\\sinh x\\sin y$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:721
msgid "Returns $\\tanh z$; for $|x| \\ge 1$ a form scaled by $e^{-2|x|}$ that tends to $\\pm 1$ without overflow."
msgstr "返回 $\\tanh z$；当 $|x| \\ge 1$ 时使用以 $e^{-2|x|}$ 缩放的形式，它趋于 $\\pm 1$ 而不会上溢。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:730
msgid "Returns $1/\\cosh z$ through `Complex::inv`; like `sec`, it does not hit the poles $i(\\pi/2 + k\\pi)$ exactly."
msgstr "经由 `Complex::inv` 返回 $1/\\cosh z$；与 `sec` 一样，它不会精确命中极点 $i(\\pi/2 + k\\pi)$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:739
msgid "Returns $1/\\sinh z$; aborts at $z = 0$ and where $|\\sinh z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$."
msgstr "返回 $1/\\sinh z$；在 $z = 0$ 以及 $|\\sinh z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:748
msgid "Returns $1/\\tanh z$; aborts at $z = 0$ and where $|\\tanh z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$."
msgstr "返回 $1/\\tanh z$；在 $z = 0$ 以及 $|\\tanh z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:755
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic functions"
msgstr "反双曲函数"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:759
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{asinh} z = -i\\operatorname{asin}(iz)$, with branch cuts on the imaginary axis outside $[-i, i]$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{asinh} z = -i\\operatorname{asin}(iz)$，分支切割线位于虚轴上 $[-i, i]$ 之外。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:766
msgid "Real inputs use the real `asinh`; purely imaginary inputs $iy$ give $i\\arcsin y$ for $|y| \\le 1$ and $\\pm(\\operatorname{acosh}|y| + i\\pi/2)$ otherwise."
msgstr "实数输入使用实数 `asinh`；纯虚数输入 $iy$ 在 $|y| \\le 1$ 时得到 $i\\arcsin y$，否则得到 $\\pm(\\operatorname{acosh}|y| + i\\pi/2)$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:771
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{acosh} z = 2\\ln\\Big(\\sqrt{\\tfrac{z+1}{2}} + \\sqrt{\\tfrac{z-1}{2}}\\Big)$, with the branch cut on the real axis below $1$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{acosh} z = 2\\ln\\Big(\\sqrt{\\tfrac{z+1}{2}} + \\sqrt{\\tfrac{z-1}{2}}\\Big)$，分支切割线位于实轴上 $1$ 以下的部分。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:778
msgid "Real inputs go to `acosh_real`; an infinite part gives $\\infty + i\\arg z$."
msgstr "实数输入交给 `acosh_real`；含无穷分量时得到 $\\infty + i\\arg z$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:782
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic cosine of a real number: $\\operatorname{acosh} x$ for $x \\ge 1$, $i\\arccos x$ for $-1 \\le x < 1$, $\\operatorname{acosh}(-x) + 2\\pi i$ for $x < -1$."
msgstr "实数的反双曲余弦：$x \\ge 1$ 时为 $\\operatorname{acosh} x$，$-1 \\le x < 1$ 时为 $i\\arccos x$，$x < -1$ 时为 $\\operatorname{acosh}(-x) + 2\\pi i$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:792
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{atanh} z$, with branch cuts on the real axis outside $[-1, 1]$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{atanh} z$，分支切割线位于实轴上 $[-1, 1]$ 之外。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:799
msgid "The real part is $\\tfrac14\\ln\\frac{(1+x)^2 + y^2}{(1-x)^2 + y^2}$ (with `log1p` near zero), the imaginary part $\\tfrac12\\operatorname{atan2}(2y, 1 - x^2 - y^2)$, rescaled for large inputs. Infinite inputs return $0 \\pm i\\pi/2$."
msgstr "实部为 $\\tfrac14\\ln\\frac{(1+x)^2 + y^2}{(1-x)^2 + y^2}$（在零附近使用 `log1p`），虚部为 $\\tfrac12\\operatorname{atan2}(2y, 1 - x^2 - y^2)$，对大输入会重新缩放。无穷输入返回 $0 \\pm i\\pi/2$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:806
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic tangent of a real number: $\\operatorname{atanh} x$ for $|x| < 1$, $\\pm\\infty$ at $\\pm 1$, and $\\operatorname{atanh}(1/x) + i\\pi/2$ for $|x| > 1$."
msgstr "实数的反双曲正切：$|x| < 1$ 时为 $\\operatorname{atanh} x$，在 $\\pm 1$ 处为 $\\pm\\infty$，$|x| > 1$ 时为 $\\operatorname{atanh}(1/x) + i\\pi/2$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:816
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{acosh}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$. For real $-1 < x < 0$ it goes through `acosh_real(1/x)` and returns the imaginary part $2\\pi$ instead of $\\pi$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{acosh}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。对实数 $-1 < x < 0$，它经由 `acosh_real(1/x)` 计算，虚部返回 $2\\pi$ 而不是 $\\pi$。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:826
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{asinh}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{asinh}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。"

#: manual/api/float_backend.md:834
msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{atanh}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$."
msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{atanh}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。"

#: manual/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contribution guidelines"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: manual/contributing.md:3
msgid "This guide collects the rules for changing `luna-complex`. Run `./ready_to_pr.sh` before opening a pull request."
msgstr "本指南汇集了修改 `luna-complex` 时应遵循的规则。提交拉取请求前请运行 `./ready_to_pr.sh`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:6
msgid "Code style"
msgstr "代码风格"

#: manual/contributing.md:8
msgid "Format all code with `moon fmt`."
msgstr "所有代码统一使用 `moon fmt` 格式化。"

#: manual/contributing.md:9
msgid "Prefer the shared `using` imports in `src/alias.mbt` and `src/float_backend/alias.mbt` over repeated fully qualified calls."
msgstr "优先使用 `src/alias.mbt` 和 `src/float_backend/alias.mbt` 中共享的 `using` 导入，而不是反复写完全限定调用。"

#: manual/contributing.md:11
msgid "Keep comments short and technical. Comments explain numerical stability choices, branch selection or non-obvious contracts; they do not restate the code."
msgstr "注释应简短且技术化。注释用于解释数值稳定性的取舍、分支选择或不明显的约定；不要复述代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:14
msgid "Promote trait methods explicitly in `src/extends.mbt`; deprecated method forms stay there with `#deprecated` and `#doc(hidden)`."
msgstr "在 `src/extends.mbt` 中显式提升 trait 方法；已弃用的方法形式保留在那里，并带有 `#deprecated` 和 `#doc(hidden)`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:17
msgid "Naming"
msgstr "命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:19
msgid "Bindings and functions: lowercase with underscores, such as `pow_real`."
msgstr "绑定与函数：小写加下划线，如 `pow_real`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:20
msgid "Types and traits: PascalCase, such as `Complex` or `FloatingBackendScalar`."
msgstr "类型与 trait：PascalCase，如 `Complex` 或 `FloatingBackendScalar`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:22
msgid "Files: lowercase with underscores, named after the behaviour they own. Avoid catch-all files such as `utils.mbt`."
msgstr "文件：小写加下划线，按其负责的行为命名。避免 `utils.mbt` 这类大杂烩文件。"

#: manual/contributing.md:25
msgid "Package boundaries"
msgstr "包边界"

#: manual/contributing.md:27
msgid "The root package owns the generic `Complex[T]`: construction, mutation, algebraic operations and `luna-generic` instances. It contains no floating-point semantics."
msgstr "根包负责泛型的 `Complex[T]`：构造、修改、代数运算以及 `luna-generic` 实例。它不包含任何浮点语义。"

#: manual/contributing.md:30
msgid "`src/float_backend` owns the floating-point capability traits and the analytic functions. Under current MoonBit rules a package cannot add methods or trait instances to a type of another package, so these are free functions."
msgstr "`src/float_backend` 负责浮点能力 trait 与解析函数。按照当前 MoonBit 的规则，一个包不能为另一个包的类型添加方法或 trait 实例，因此这些都是自由函数。"

#: manual/contributing.md:34
msgid "Add an instance to `Complex[T]` only when the construction satisfies its laws under the stated bound; see the [core design](design/core.md)."
msgstr "仅当该构造在所述约束下满足相应定律时，才为 `Complex[T]` 添加实例；参见[核心设计](design/core.md)。"

#: manual/contributing.md:36
msgid "Keep public API changes deliberate; internal helpers stay private."
msgstr "公开 API 的变更须经过深思熟虑；内部辅助函数保持私有。"

#: manual/contributing.md:38
msgid "Numerical changes"
msgstr "数值相关的修改"

#: manual/contributing.md:40
msgid "State the formula and the reason for any rescaling or special case in the [float_backend design](design/float_backend.md), and the observable branch and special-value behaviour in the [float_backend API](api/float_backend.md)."
msgstr "在 [float_backend 设计](design/float_backend.md)中写明公式以及任何重新缩放或特殊情形的理由，并在 [float_backend API](api/float_backend.md) 中写明可观察到的分支与特殊值行为。"

#: manual/contributing.md:44
msgid "Add regression tests for every changed numerical behaviour: identities such as `exp(log z) = z`, values on and near branch cuts, huge and tiny inputs, and special values."
msgstr "为每一项改变的数值行为添加回归测试：如 `exp(log z) = z` 之类的恒等式、分支切割线上及其附近的值、极大与极小的输入，以及特殊值。"

#: manual/contributing.md:48
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试要求"

#: manual/contributing.md:50
msgid "Black-box tests live in `*_test.mbt` next to the code and use qualified names such as `@luna-complex.Complex::new`."
msgstr "黑盒测试位于代码旁的 `*_test.mbt` 中，并使用限定名，如 `@luna-complex.Complex::new`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:52
msgid "Run `moon test` on all targets you change behaviour for, and `moon test --enable-coverage` before submitting."
msgstr "对所有行为发生变化的目标运行 `moon test`，提交前运行 `moon test --enable-coverage`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:54
msgid "Regenerate `pkg.generated.mbti` with `moon info` whenever the public API changes, and review its diff."
msgstr "公开 API 变化时，用 `moon info` 重新生成 `pkg.generated.mbti`，并检查其差异。"

#: manual/contributing.md:57
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: manual/contributing.md:59
msgid "The manual lives in `doc/manual`. After changing English pages, run `lunadoc update` and update the Chinese and Japanese catalogs in `doc/locale`."
msgstr "手册位于 `doc/manual`。修改英文页面后，运行 `lunadoc update` 并更新 `doc/locale` 中的中文和日文翻译目录。"

#: manual/contributing.md:62
msgid "Code examples in the manual must compile against the current code."
msgstr "手册中的代码示例必须能针对当前代码编译通过。"

#: manual/contributing.md:64
msgid "Commits and releases"
msgstr "提交与发布"

#: manual/contributing.md:66
msgid "Use English Conventional Commits, such as `fix(float_backend): use pi on the negative real axis`."
msgstr "使用英文的 Conventional Commits，例如 `fix(float_backend): use pi on the negative real axis`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:68
msgid "Keep each commit focused on one logical change."
msgstr "每次提交只聚焦一个逻辑变更。"

#: manual/contributing.md:69
msgid "Before publishing, update the version in `moon.mod`, update `README.md` and `CHANGELOG.md`, run `moon check` and `moon test --enable-coverage`, and trigger the publish workflow with the exact version from `moon.mod`."
msgstr "发布前，更新 `moon.mod` 中的版本号，更新 `README.md` 和 `CHANGELOG.md`，运行 `moon check` 和 `moon test --enable-coverage`，并使用与 `moon.mod` 完全一致的版本号触发发布工作流。"

#: manual/contributing.md:72
msgid "If you are not a maintainer, ask before changing dependency or version declarations in `moon.mod`."
msgstr "如果你不是维护者，修改 `moon.mod` 中的依赖或版本声明前请先询问。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "core design"
msgstr "core 设计"

#: manual/design/core.md:3
msgid "This page derives the algebra of `Complex[T]`, states when each `luna-generic` instance is lawful, and explains the choices behind the generic type: mutable fields, the unscaled division formula, and the separation from floating-point analysis."
msgstr "本页推导 `Complex[T]` 的代数结构，说明每个 `luna-generic` 实例在何时合法，并解释泛型类型背后的设计选择：可变字段、未缩放的除法公式，以及与浮点分析的分离。"

#: manual/design/core.md:8
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:8
msgid "Design goal"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/core.md:10
msgid "One generic complex type for every scalar of the ecosystem, whose instances advertise exactly the algebraic structure the construction has, and which leaves IEEE special values, branch cuts and transcendental functions to a backend package."
msgstr "为生态中的每种标量提供同一个泛型复数类型，其实例所声明的代数结构恰好是该构造所具有的结构，而 IEEE 特殊值、分支切割线和超越函数则交给后端包处理。"

#: manual/design/core.md:15
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:16
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: manual/design/core.md:17
msgid "`T` ranges over exact rings (`Int`, `BigInt`, exact rationals), the floating-point types `Float` and `Double`, and other complex types, so the core may use only the operations of the `luna-generic` traits: no order, no absolute value, no special values."
msgstr "`T` 可以是精确环（`Int`、`BigInt`、精确有理数）、浮点类型 `Float` 和 `Double`，以及其他复数类型，因此核心包只能使用 `luna-generic` trait 提供的运算：没有序、没有绝对值、没有特殊值。"

#: manual/design/core.md:21
msgid "An instance must not claim more structure than the construction has under its bound."
msgstr "实例声称的结构不能超过该构造在其约束下实际具有的结构。"

#: manual/design/core.md:23
msgid "A package cannot add methods or trait instances to a type of another package, so whatever needs floating-point semantics has to live in a separate package as free functions."
msgstr "一个包不能为另一个包的类型添加方法或 trait 实例，因此凡是需要浮点语义的东西都必须以自由函数的形式放在单独的包中。"

#: manual/design/core.md:27
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:30
msgid "Main design decisions"
msgstr "主要设计决策"

#: manual/design/core.md:29
msgid "One generic `Complex[T]` with public mutable fields."
msgstr "一个带有公开可变字段的泛型 `Complex[T]`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:30
msgid "Instances follow the structure of `T`: componentwise operations need only the matching operations of `T`, multiplication needs `T : Ring`, inverses need `T : Field`."
msgstr "实例跟随 `T` 的结构：逐分量运算只需要 `T` 的相应运算，乘法需要 `T : Ring`，求逆需要 `T : Field`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:33
msgid "The schoolbook product with four multiplications."
msgstr "使用四次乘法的教科书乘积。"

#: manual/design/core.md:34
msgid "Textbook division through `Inverse::inv` of the norm, because a generic field has nothing else."
msgstr "通过范数的 `Inverse::inv` 做教科书除法，因为泛型域没有别的手段。"

#: manual/design/core.md:36
msgid "No analytic functions in the core; `float_backend` provides them for `Double`."
msgstr "核心包中没有解析函数；`float_backend` 为 `Double` 提供它们。"

#: manual/design/core.md:39
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:42
msgid "Mathematical background"
msgstr "数学背景"

#: manual/design/core.md:41
msgid "The construction"
msgstr "构造"

#: manual/design/core.md:43
msgid "For a ring $R$, the complex numbers over $R$ are the quotient of the polynomial ring in a central indeterminate $x$ by the two-sided ideal generated by $x^2 + 1$:"
msgstr "对于环 $R$，$R$ 上的复数是以中心不定元 $x$ 构成的多项式环对由 $x^2 + 1$ 生成的双边理想所作的商："

#: manual/design/core.md:51
msgid "Division by the monic polynomial $x^2 + 1$ leaves a unique remainder of degree below two, so every element is $a + bi$ with unique $a, b \\in R$: the pair `(re, im)`. Computing with polynomials and reducing $i^2 = -1$ gives the operations of the package:"
msgstr "用首一多项式 $x^2 + 1$ 做除法会留下唯一一个次数低于二的余式，因此每个元素都可唯一地写成 $a + bi$（$a, b \\in R$）：即二元组 `(re, im)`。用多项式计算并以 $i^2 = -1$ 化简，便得到本包的各项运算："

#: manual/design/core.md:63
msgid "As a quotient of a ring by a two-sided ideal, $R[i]$ is a ring, with zero $0 + 0i$ and one $1 + 0i$; $R$ embeds as $a \\mapsto a + 0i$. The product formula keeps the factors of $R$ in their order ($ac$, $ad$, $bc$, $bd$) and moves only $i$, which commutes with everything because $x$ is central. So the formula is associative and distributive even when $R$ is not commutative, which is why `MulMonoid`, `Semiring` and `Ring` need only `T : Ring`. $R[i]$ is commutative exactly when $R$ is."
msgstr "作为环对双边理想的商，$R[i]$ 是一个环，零元为 $0 + 0i$，单位元为 $1 + 0i$；$R$ 通过 $a \\mapsto a + 0i$ 嵌入其中。乘积公式保持 $R$ 中因子的次序（$ac$、$ad$、$bc$、$bd$），只移动 $i$，而 $i$ 因为 $x$ 是中心元而与一切元素可交换。所以即使 $R$ 不交换，该公式也满足结合律和分配律，这就是 `MulMonoid`、`Semiring` 和 `Ring` 只需要 `T : Ring` 的原因。$R[i]$ 可交换当且仅当 $R$ 可交换。"

#: manual/design/core.md:71
msgid "The rest of this page assumes $R$ commutative: the norm below lies in $R$ only then. For $z = a + bi$ over a non-commutative $R$, $z\\bar z = (a^2 + b^2) + (ba - ab)i$."
msgstr "本页其余部分假设 $R$ 可交换：只有这时下面的范数才落在 $R$ 中。对非交换的 $R$ 上的 $z = a + bi$，$z\\bar z = (a^2 + b^2) + (ba - ab)i$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:75
msgid "Conjugation and the norm"
msgstr "共轭与范数"

#: manual/design/core.md:77
msgid "$\\overline{a + bi} = a - bi$ is the map induced by $x \\mapsto -x$, which fixes the ideal $(x^2 + 1)$, so it is a ring automorphism of order two:"
msgstr "$\\overline{a + bi} = a - bi$ 是由 $x \\mapsto -x$ 诱导的映射，它保持理想 $(x^2 + 1)$ 不变，因此是一个二阶环自同构："

#: manual/design/core.md:85
msgid "The norm $N(z) = z\\bar z = (a + bi)(a - bi) = a^2 + b^2$ lies in $R$ and is multiplicative, $N(zw) = zw\\,\\bar z\\bar w = N(z)N(w)$."
msgstr "范数 $N(z) = z\\bar z = (a + bi)(a - bi) = a^2 + b^2$ 属于 $R$，并且是乘性的：$N(zw) = zw\\,\\bar z\\bar w = N(z)N(w)$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:88
msgid "Inverses and division"
msgstr "逆元与除法"

#: manual/design/core.md:90
msgid "If $N(z)$ is invertible in $R$, then $z \\cdot \\bar z\\,N(z)^{-1} = 1$, so"
msgstr "若 $N(z)$ 在 $R$ 中可逆，则 $z \\cdot \\bar z\\,N(z)^{-1} = 1$，因此"

#: manual/design/core.md:98
msgid "Conversely, if $z$ is invertible then $N(z)N(z^{-1}) = N(1) = 1$, so $N(z)$ is invertible. Hence $z$ is a unit exactly when $a^2 + b^2$ is."
msgstr "反之，若 $z$ 可逆，则 $N(z)N(z^{-1}) = N(1) = 1$，因此 $N(z)$ 可逆。所以 $z$ 是单位当且仅当 $a^2 + b^2$ 是单位。"

#: manual/design/core.md:101
msgid "When the construction is a field"
msgstr "何时该构造是域"

#: manual/design/core.md:103
msgid ""
"Let $K$ be a field. $K[x]/(x^2 + 1)$ is a field exactly when $x^2 + 1$ is irreducible over $K$, that is when $-1$ is not a square in $K$. Directly: a non-zero $z$ with $N(z) = a^2 + b^2 = 0$ must have $b \\n"
"e 0$, and then $(a/b)^2 = -1$. Conversely, if $s^2 = -1$ then $(s + i)(s - i) = s^2 + 1 = 0$ exhibits zero divisors."
msgstr ""
"设 $K$ 为域。$K[x]/(x^2 + 1)$ 是域当且仅当 $x^2 + 1$ 在 $K$ 上不可约，即 $-1$ 在 $K$ 中不是平方数。直接来看：满足 $N(z) = a^2 + b^2 = 0$ 的非零 $z$ 必有 $b \\n"
"e 0$，从而 $(a/b)^2 = -1$。反之，若 $s^2 = -1$，则 $(s + i)(s - i) = s^2 + 1 = 0$ 给出了零因子。"

#: manual/design/core.md:109
msgid "For $K = \\mathbb R$ (`Float`, `Double`), $-1$ is not a square and $\\mathbb R[i] = \\mathbb C$ is a field."
msgstr "对于 $K = \\mathbb R$（`Float`、`Double`），$-1$ 不是平方数，$\\mathbb R[i] = \\mathbb C$ 是域。"

#: manual/design/core.md:111
msgid "For $K = \\mathbb C$ (`Complex[Double]`), $-1 = i^2$ is a square, so `Complex[Complex[Double]]` $\\cong \\mathbb C[j]/(j^2 + 1) \\cong \\mathbb C \\times \\mathbb C$ is a ring with zero divisors, such as $(1 + ij)(1 - ij) = 1 - i^2 j^2 = 0$."
msgstr "对于 $K = \\mathbb C$（`Complex[Double]`），$-1 = i^2$ 是平方数，因此 `Complex[Complex[Double]]` $\\cong \\mathbb C[j]/(j^2 + 1) \\cong \\mathbb C \\times \\mathbb C$ 是一个含零因子的环，例如 $(1 + ij)(1 - ij) = 1 - i^2 j^2 = 0$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:116
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:115
msgid "Decisions in detail"
msgstr "决策详解"

#: manual/design/core.md:118
msgid "Instances follow the structure of `T`"
msgstr "实例跟随 `T` 的结构"

#: manual/design/core.md:120
msgid "**Problem.** Which `luna-generic` traits may `Complex[T]` implement?"
msgstr "**问题。** `Complex[T]` 可以实现哪些 `luna-generic` trait？"

#: manual/design/core.md:122
msgid "**Choice.** `Zero`, `One`, `AddMonoid` and `AddGroup` need only the corresponding operations of `T`, because they act componentwise. `MulMonoid`, `Semiring` and `Ring` need `T : Ring`, because the product uses subtraction ($ac - bd$) and the ring laws of $R[i]$ need those of $R$. `Inverse`, `MulGroup`, `Field` and the `Div` operator need `T : Field` for $N(z)^{-1}$. `Conjugate` needs only `Neg`."
msgstr "**选择。** `Zero`、`One`、`AddMonoid` 和 `AddGroup` 只需要 `T` 的相应运算，因为它们逐分量作用。`MulMonoid`、`Semiring` 和 `Ring` 需要 `T : Ring`，因为乘积要用到减法（$ac - bd$），而 $R[i]$ 的环公理依赖于 $R$ 的环公理。`Inverse`、`MulGroup`、`Field` 以及 `Div` 运算符需要 `T : Field` 来计算 $N(z)^{-1}$。`Conjugate` 只需要 `Neg`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:129
msgid "The `Field` instance is declared for every `T : Field`. By the previous section that is lawful when $-1$ is not a square in `T`, which covers the real scalar types; for `T = Complex[Double]` it is not, and `inv` aborts on non-zero zero divisors. A trait bound cannot express \"−1 is not a square\", so the instance trusts the caller here.[^honesty]"
msgstr "`Field` 实例对每个 `T : Field` 都有声明。由上一节可知，当 $-1$ 在 `T` 中不是平方数时它是合法的，这涵盖了实数标量类型；对于 `T = Complex[Double]` 则不然，`inv` 会在非零的零因子上中止。trait 约束无法表达“−1 不是平方数”，因此该实例在这里信任调用者。[^honesty]"

#: manual/design/core.md:135
msgid "This is a known gap in the \"implement only lawful instances\" rule of Luna Flow. The test suite uses nested complex numbers only on values with an invertible norm."
msgstr "这是 Luna Flow“只实现合法实例”这一规则中的一个已知缺口。测试套件只在范数可逆的值上使用嵌套复数。"

#: manual/design/core.md:139
msgid "Four multiplications"
msgstr "四次乘法"

#: manual/design/core.md:141
msgid "**Options.** The schoolbook product $(ac - bd) + (ad + bc)i$ with four multiplications; Gauss's three-multiplication form $k_1 = c(a + b)$, $k_2 = a(d - c)$, $k_3 = b(c + d)$, product $(k_1 - k_3) + (k_1 + k_2)i$."
msgstr "**备选方案。** 使用四次乘法的教科书式乘积 $(ac - bd) + (ad + bc)i$；高斯的三次乘法形式 $k_1 = c(a + b)$、$k_2 = a(d - c)$、$k_3 = b(c + d)$，乘积为 $(k_1 - k_3) + (k_1 + k_2)i$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:145
msgid "**Choice.** Four multiplications. Over floating point the schoolbook form has a normwise relative error of at most $\\sqrt5\\,u$,[^bpz] while the three-multiplication form adds cancellation-prone sums such as $a + b$ and $d - c$ and is less accurate componentwise; and for generic `T` a multiplication is not necessarily more expensive than an addition."
msgstr "**选择。** 四次乘法。在浮点下，教科书形式的按范数相对误差至多为 $\\sqrt5\\,u$，[^bpz] 而三次乘法形式引入了 $a + b$、$d - c$ 这类容易相消的和，按分量的精度更差；并且对于泛型 `T`，乘法不一定比加法更昂贵。"

#: manual/design/core.md:151
msgid "R. Brent, C. Percival and P. Zimmermann, \"Error bounds on complex floating-point multiplication\", *Mathematics of Computation* 76 (2007)."
msgstr "R. Brent, C. Percival and P. Zimmermann, \"Error bounds on complex floating-point multiplication\", *Mathematics of Computation* 76 (2007)."

#: manual/design/core.md:154
msgid "Componentwise, $\\mathrm{fl}(ac - bd) = ac(1 + \\theta_2) - bd(1 + \\theta_2')$ with $|\\theta_2| \\le \\gamma_2 = 2u/(1 - 2u)$, so"
msgstr "按分量看，$\\mathrm{fl}(ac - bd) = ac(1 + \\theta_2) - bd(1 + \\theta_2')$，其中 $|\\theta_2| \\le \\gamma_2 = 2u/(1 - 2u)$，因此"

#: manual/design/core.md:161
msgid "which is small relative to the result unless $ac$ and $bd$ cancel."
msgstr "除非 $ac$ 与 $bd$ 相消，否则它相对于结果是很小的。"

#: manual/design/core.md:163
msgid "Textbook division in the generic core"
msgstr "泛型核心中的教科书式除法"

#: manual/design/core.md:165
msgid "**Problem.** Division needs $N(w)^{-1}$; for floating point, $c^2 + d^2$ overflows or underflows long before $c + di$ does."
msgstr "**问题。** 除法需要 $N(w)^{-1}$；对浮点数而言，$c^2 + d^2$ 远在 $c + di$ 之前就会上溢或下溢。"

#: manual/design/core.md:168
msgid "**Options.** Scaled algorithms (Smith's, or rescaling by a power of two) need comparisons and absolute values that a generic field does not have; the textbook formula needs only field operations."
msgstr "**备选方案。** 带缩放的算法（Smith 算法，或按 2 的幂重新缩放）需要比较和绝对值，而泛型域不具备这些；教科书公式只需要域运算。"

#: manual/design/core.md:172
msgid "**Choice.** The generic `Div` and `Inverse` use the textbook formula with `Inverse::inv` of `T`. It is exact for exact fields. For `Double` it is correct while $c^2 + d^2$ stays in range, and `Inverse` of `Double` aborts on zero, including an underflowed norm. Scaled, special-value-aware division lives in [`float_backend`](float_backend.md#smiths-division)."
msgstr "**选择。** 泛型的 `Div` 和 `Inverse` 使用教科书公式，配合 `T` 的 `Inverse::inv`。对于精确的域它是精确的。对于 `Double`，只要 $c^2 + d^2$ 不超出范围它就是正确的，而 `Double` 的 `Inverse` 在遇到零（包括下溢后的范数）时中止。带缩放且考虑特殊值的除法位于 [`float_backend`](float_backend.md#smiths-division)。"

#: manual/design/core.md:178
msgid "Mutable fields"
msgstr "可变字段"

#: manual/design/core.md:180
msgid "**Problem.** Complex values are often updated in loops (accumulators, recurrences), where allocating a new value per step is wasteful."
msgstr "**问题。** 复数值常常在循环中更新（累加器、递推），每一步都分配新值是一种浪费。"

#: manual/design/core.md:183
msgid "**Choice.** `Complex[T]` is a `pub(all)` struct with `mut re` and `mut im` plus `set`, `set_re` and `set_im`. Every operation returns a new value and never mutates its inputs, so code that does not call the setters can treat complex numbers as values. Callers that do mutate must remember that the struct is shared by reference."
msgstr "**选择。** `Complex[T]` 是一个 `pub(all)` 结构体，带有 `mut re` 和 `mut im`，以及 `set`、`set_re` 和 `set_im`。每个运算都返回新值，从不修改其输入，因此不调用这些 setter 的代码可以把复数当作值来对待。确实要修改的调用者必须记住该结构体是按引用共享的。"

#: manual/design/core.md:189
msgid "No analytic functions in the core"
msgstr "核心中没有解析函数"

#: manual/design/core.md:191
msgid "$\\sqrt z$, $\\log z$ or $\\sin z$ need an order, absolute values, transcendental functions of the real scalar, a choice of branch, and IEEE special values. None of these exist for a generic field. The root package therefore stops at algebra, and the [float_backend](float_backend.md) package supplies analysis for `Double`."
msgstr "$\\sqrt z$、$\\log z$ 或 $\\sin z$ 需要序、绝对值、实数标量的超越函数、分支的选择以及 IEEE 特殊值。这些对泛型域都不存在。因此根包止步于代数，由 [float_backend](float_backend.md) 包为 `Double` 提供分析功能。"

#: manual/design/core.md:197
msgid "Text and debug forms"
msgstr "文本与调试形式"

#: manual/design/core.md:199
msgid "`Show` prints `re + imi` using `T`'s text (`1 + -2i` for $1 - 2i$), which is the canonical text of the type and the reason `to_string` stays a promoted method. `Debug` prints the record form for tests and diagnostics. MoonBit 0.10 promotion of the other trait methods is explicit in [`src/extends.mbt`](../../../src/extends.mbt)."
msgstr "`Show` 使用 `T` 的文本打印 `re + imi`（$1 - 2i$ 打印为 `1 + -2i`），这是该类型的规范文本，也是 `to_string` 保留为提升方法的原因。`Debug` 为测试和诊断打印记录形式。MoonBit 0.10 中其他 trait 方法的提升在 [`src/extends.mbt`](../../../src/extends.mbt) 中显式完成。"

#: manual/design/core.md:205
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:394
msgid "Correctness and invariants"
msgstr "正确性与不变量"

#: manual/design/core.md:207
msgid "Ring laws hold for `T : Ring` because $R[i]$ is a quotient ring; the test suite checks associativity, identities and $\\overline{zw} = \\bar z\\bar w$ on integers."
msgstr "对于 `T : Ring`，由于 $R[i]$ 是商环，环公理成立；测试套件在整数上检查结合律、单位元以及 $\\overline{zw} = \\bar z\\bar w$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:210
msgid "`z * z.conjugate()` equals $N(z) + 0i$ exactly for exact `T`."
msgstr "对于精确的 `T`，`z * z.conjugate()` 精确等于 $N(z) + 0i$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:211
msgid "`z * w / w == z` and `z.inv() * z == 1` hold for exact fields when $N(w)$, $N(z)$ are units, and up to rounding for `Double` within range."
msgstr "当 $N(w)$、$N(z)$ 为单位时，`z * w / w == z` 与 `z.inv() * z == 1` 对精确的域成立；对 `Double` 在范围内则在舍入误差意义下成立。"

#: manual/design/core.md:213
msgid "No operation mutates its arguments; only the three setters do."
msgstr "没有任何运算会修改其参数；只有三个 setter 会。"

#: manual/design/core.md:215
msgid "Floating-point instances"
msgstr "浮点实例"

#: manual/design/core.md:217
msgid "For `T = Double` every law holds only up to rounding, and the unscaled norm adds hard limits. Let $\\Omega \\approx 1.80 \\times 10^{308}$ be the largest finite `Double`, $\\lambda = 2^{-1022} \\approx 2.2 \\times 10^{-308}$ the smallest normal one and $\\mu = 2^{-1074} \\approx 4.9 \\times 10^{-324}$ the smallest subnormal one. The norm $n = \\mathrm{fl}(c^2 + d^2)$ of $w = c + di$ behaves as follows:"
msgstr "对于 `T = Double`，每条定律都只在舍入意义下成立，而未缩放的范数还带来硬性界限。设 $\\Omega \\approx 1.80 \\times 10^{308}$ 为最大的有限 `Double`，$\\lambda = 2^{-1022} \\approx 2.2 \\times 10^{-308}$ 为最小的正规数，$\\mu = 2^{-1074} \\approx 4.9 \\times 10^{-324}$ 为最小的次正规数。$w = c + di$ 的范数 $n = \\mathrm{fl}(c^2 + d^2)$ 的行为如下："

#: manual/design/core.md:236
msgid ""
"The last line uses that a square below half the smallest subnormal rounds to zero. In the first case $n^{-1} = 0$ and `inv` returns zero parts, so $z z^{-1} = 0 \\n"
"e 1$; in the third the parts are $\\pm\\infty$ or NaN; in the fourth `Inverse::inv` of `Double` aborts. The field law $z z^{-1} = 1$ for every $z \\n"
"e 0$ therefore fails outside roughly $10^{-154} \\le |z| \\le 10^{154}$, which is the honest domain of the `Field` instance for `Complex[Double]`. [`float_backend`](float_backend.md#smiths-division) divides without forming $c^2 + d^2$."
msgstr ""
"最后一行用到：小于最小次正规数一半的平方会舍入为零。第一种情况下 $n^{-1} = 0$，`inv` 返回零分量，所以 $z z^{-1} = 0 \\n"
"e 1$；第三种情况下分量为 $\\pm\\infty$ 或 NaN；第四种情况下 `Double` 的 `Inverse::inv` 中止。因此对所有 $z \\n"
"e 0$ 的域定律 $z z^{-1} = 1$ 在大约 $10^{-154} \\le |z| \\le 10^{154}$ 之外不成立，这才是 `Complex[Double]` 的 `Field` 实例的真实适用范围。[`float_backend`](float_backend.md#smiths-division) 做除法时不形成 $c^2 + d^2$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:245
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:491
msgid "Alternatives rejected"
msgstr "被否决的方案"

#: manual/design/core.md:247
msgid "**A `Double`-only complex type.** It would duplicate the type for `Float`, integers (Gaussian integers) and exact rationals."
msgstr "**仅支持 `Double` 的复数类型。** 这会导致为 `Float`、整数（高斯整数）和精确有理数重复定义该类型。"

#: manual/design/core.md:249
msgid "**Immutable fields.** Cleaner value semantics, but a breaking change for existing callers that update `re` and `im` in place."
msgstr "**不可变字段。** 值语义更清晰，但对原地更新 `re` 和 `im` 的现有调用者来说是破坏性变更。"

#: manual/design/core.md:251
msgid "**Scaled division in the core.** It needs order and magnitude operations that generic fields lack."
msgstr "**在核心中做带缩放的除法。** 它需要泛型域所缺乏的序和量级运算。"

#: manual/design/core.md:254
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:504
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

#: manual/design/core.md:256
msgid "No analytic or transcendental functions, no special-value handling, no branch cuts; see [float_backend](float_backend.md)."
msgstr "不提供解析函数或超越函数，不做特殊值处理，没有分支切割线；参见 [float_backend](float_backend.md)。"

#: manual/design/core.md:258
msgid "No polar representation in the core."
msgstr "核心中没有极坐标表示。"

#: manual/design/core.md:259
msgid "No check that `T` makes $R[i]$ a field; the `Field` instance trusts it."
msgstr "不检查 `T` 是否使 $R[i]$ 成为域；`Field` 实例信任这一点。"

#: manual/design/core.md:260
msgid "No overflow-safe division for floating-point `T`."
msgstr "不为浮点 `T` 提供防上溢的除法。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:1
msgid "float_backend design"
msgstr "float_backend 设计"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:3
msgid "This page derives the formulas that `float_backend` implements for `Complex[Double]`, explains how each one avoids overflow, underflow and cancellation, states the branch cuts and principal values, and explains why the scalar capabilities are split into three traits."
msgstr "本页推导 `float_backend` 为 `Complex[Double]` 实现的公式，解释每个公式如何避免上溢、下溢和相消，给出分支切割线与主值，并解释为何将标量能力拆分为三个 trait。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:10
msgid "Provide the elementary functions of $\\mathbb C$ for `Complex[Double]` with principal values on documented branch cuts, numerically stable formulas over the whole `Double` range, and the IEEE special values handled where it matters, while keeping all of this out of the generic [core](core.md)."
msgstr "为 `Complex[Double]` 提供 $\\mathbb C$ 的初等函数：在明确记录的分支切割线上取主值，在整个 `Double` 范围内使用数值稳定的公式，并在要紧之处处理 IEEE 特殊值，同时让这一切都不进入泛型[核心](core.md)。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:18
msgid "The functions must work over the whole `Double` range: $x^2 + y^2$ overflows for $|z| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ and underflows for $|z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$, although $z$ and most results are representable."
msgstr "函数必须在整个 `Double` 范围内工作：$|z| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ 时 $x^2 + y^2$ 上溢，$|z| < 1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时下溢，尽管 $z$ 和大多数结果都是可表示的。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:22
msgid "Near the branch points and the branch cuts the textbook formulas cancel catastrophically."
msgstr "在分支点和分支切割线附近，教科书公式会出现灾难性的相消。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:24
msgid "The package cannot add methods to `Complex[T]`, which belongs to the core package."
msgstr "本包不能为属于核心包的 `Complex[T]` 添加方法。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:26
msgid "The real elementary functions come from `arithmetic` and `Kaida-Amethyst/math`; the package does not implement real transcendental functions itself."
msgstr "实初等函数来自 `arithmetic` 和 `Kaida-Amethyst/math`；本包自己不实现实超越函数。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:32
msgid "Free functions over `Complex[Double]`, with `_real` variants that take a `Double`."
msgstr "在 `Complex[Double]` 上的自由函数，以及接受 `Double` 的 `_real` 变体。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:34
msgid "Scaled formulas for the modulus, the square root, division, the tangent and the inverse functions; the Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang algorithm for the arcsine and arccosine; Kahan's formula for the inverse hyperbolic cosine."
msgstr "对模、平方根、除法、正切和反函数使用缩放公式；反正弦和反余弦使用 Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang 算法；反双曲余弦使用 Kahan 公式。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:37
msgid "Binary powering for integer exponents."
msgstr "整数指数使用二进制快速幂。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:38
msgid "Reciprocal functions as compositions with `Complex::inv` of the core."
msgstr "倒数类函数是与核心包 `Complex::inv` 的复合。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:39
msgid "Three capability traits for the real scalar, none of which a public function uses yet."
msgstr "为实标量提供三个能力 trait，目前还没有公开函数使用它们。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:44
#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:49
msgid "Polar form"
msgstr "极坐标形式"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:46
msgid ""
"Every $z = x + iy \\n"
"e 0$ has a polar form $z = r e^{i\\theta}$ with $r = |z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$. The angle $\\theta$ is determined modulo $2\\pi$; the principal argument $\\operatorname{Arg} z$ is the representative in $(-\\pi, \\pi]$, which equals $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)$ off the negative real axis."
msgstr ""
"每个 $z = x + iy \\n"
"e 0$ 都有极坐标形式 $z = r e^{i\\theta}$，其中 $r = |z| = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$。角度 $\\theta$ 在模 $2\\pi$ 意义下确定；主辐角 $\\operatorname{Arg} z$ 是 $(-\\pi, \\pi]$ 中的代表元，在负实轴以外等于 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, x)$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:52
msgid "The principal logarithm and its branch cut"
msgstr "主值对数及其分支切割线"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:54
msgid "The solutions of $e^w = z$ are $w = \\ln|z| + i(\\operatorname{Arg} z + 2k\\pi)$. The principal logarithm takes $k = 0$:"
msgstr "$e^w = z$ 的解为 $w = \\ln|z| + i(\\operatorname{Arg} z + 2k\\pi)$。主值对数取 $k = 0$："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:61
msgid "$\\operatorname{Arg}$ jumps by $2\\pi$ across the negative real axis, so $\\operatorname{Log}$ is analytic on $\\mathbb C \\setminus (-\\infty, 0]$ and $(-\\infty, 0]$ is its *branch cut*. All other multi-valued functions are defined through $\\operatorname{Log}$ and inherit cuts from it.[^kahan]"
msgstr "$\\operatorname{Arg}$ 在跨越负实轴时跳变 $2\\pi$，因此 $\\operatorname{Log}$ 在 $\\mathbb C \\setminus (-\\infty, 0]$ 上解析，$(-\\infty, 0]$ 是它的*分支切割线*。其他所有多值函数都通过 $\\operatorname{Log}$ 定义，并从它继承割线。[^kahan]"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:66
msgid "W. Kahan, \"Branch cuts for complex elementary functions, or much ado about nothing's sign bit\", in *The State of the Art in Numerical Analysis*, Clarendon Press, 1987. It also discusses how a signed zero can select the side of a cut."
msgstr "W. Kahan, \"Branch cuts for complex elementary functions, or much ado about nothing's sign bit\", in *The State of the Art in Numerical Analysis*, Clarendon Press, 1987. 该文还讨论了带符号的零如何选择割线的一侧。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:71
msgid "Principal values of the other functions"
msgstr "其他函数的主值"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:86
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:414
msgid "Function"
msgstr "函数"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:86
#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:146
msgid "Branch cuts"
msgstr "分支切割线"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:86
msgid "Principal range"
msgstr "主值范围"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:90
msgid "$(-\\infty, 0]$ in $z$ (non-integer $w$)"
msgstr "$z$ 中的 $(-\\infty, 0]$（$w$ 非整数）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:90
msgid "from $\\operatorname{Log}$"
msgstr "由 $\\operatorname{Log}$ 决定"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:98
msgid "The reciprocal functions are compositions: $\\sec z = 1/\\cos z$, $\\operatorname{asec} z = \\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$, and so on."
msgstr "倒数类函数是复合函数：$\\sec z = 1/\\cos z$、$\\operatorname{asec} z = \\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$，依此类推。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:101
msgid "Real and imaginary parts"
msgstr "实部与虚部"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:103
msgid "The trigonometric and hyperbolic functions split by the addition theorems with $\\cos(iy) = \\cosh y$ and $\\sin(iy) = i\\sinh y$:"
msgstr "三角函数与双曲函数借助加法定理以及 $\\cos(iy) = \\cosh y$、$\\sin(iy) = i\\sinh y$ 拆分为："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:117
msgid "Three capability traits"
msgstr "三个能力 trait"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:119
msgid "**Problem.** The algorithms need more from the real scalar than `luna-generic` and `arithmetic` traits, but not every scalar type has every extra capability."
msgstr "**问题。** 这些算法对实数标量的需求超出了 `luna-generic` 和 `arithmetic` trait，但并非每种标量类型都具备所有额外能力。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:123
msgid "**Options.** One large \"floating real\" trait; no traits (hard-code `Double`); a layered set."
msgstr "**备选方案。** 一个庞大的“浮点实数” trait；不用 trait（硬编码 `Double`）；一组分层的 trait。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:126
msgid "**Choice.** Three traits, each a separate concern:"
msgstr "**选择。** 三个 trait，各自负责一个关注点："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:128
msgid "`FloatingAnalyticScalar` names the algebraic and analytic capabilities (a `Field` with `Num`, `Compare`, constants and the real elementary functions and their inverses). It assumes nothing about IEEE 754, so an exact or interval type could satisfy it."
msgstr "`FloatingAnalyticScalar` 命名代数与解析能力（带有 `Num`、`Compare`、常量以及实数初等函数及其反函数的 `Field`）。它不对 IEEE 754 做任何假设，因此精确类型或区间类型也可能满足它。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:132
msgid "`FloatingSpecialValues` names the IEEE 754 layer: NaN, signed infinities and the sign of zero. These have no meaning for a type without them, so they are not part of the analytic trait."
msgstr "`FloatingSpecialValues` 命名 IEEE 754 这一层：NaN、带符号的无穷大以及零的符号。对于没有这些值的类型，它们没有意义，因此不属于解析 trait。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:135
msgid "`FloatingBackendScalar` combines both and adds the primitives the stable algorithms below use: `hypot` (modulus without overflow), `log1p` (logarithms near one), `trunc` and `to_int` (detecting integer exponents in `pow`) and `from_double` (constants)."
msgstr "`FloatingBackendScalar` 组合了二者，并加入下面稳定算法所用的基本操作：`hypot`（不会上溢的模）、`log1p`（接近一处的对数）、`trunc` 与 `to_int`（在 `pow` 中检测整数指数）以及 `from_double`（常量）。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:140
msgid "Code can then require the smallest trait that states its needs, as Luna Flow prefers over a single \"real number\" trait. All three are implemented for `Float` and `Double`. The public functions are still written for `Complex[Double]` and call the `Double` primitives directly; no function is generic over the traits yet."
msgstr "这样代码就可以只要求能表达其需求的最小 trait，这正是 Luna Flow 相对于单一“实数” trait 所偏好的做法。三者都为 `Float` 和 `Double` 实现。公开函数目前仍针对 `Complex[Double]` 编写，并直接调用 `Double` 的基本操作；还没有对这些 trait 泛型的函数。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:146
msgid "Free functions"
msgstr "自由函数"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:148
msgid "MoonBit does not allow a package to add methods or trait instances to a type defined in another package, so the analytic functions cannot be methods of `Complex[T]`. They are free functions, `@fb.log(z)`, and the generic core stays free of floating-point semantics."
msgstr "MoonBit 不允许一个包为另一个包中定义的类型添加方法或 trait 实例，因此解析函数不能是 `Complex[T]` 的方法。它们是自由函数，如 `@fb.log(z)`，泛型核心也因此不含浮点语义。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:153
msgid "Modulus without overflow"
msgstr "不会上溢的模"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:155
msgid "The direct $\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ overflows when $|x| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$, although $|z|$ is representable, and underflows for tiny inputs. With $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$ and $t = \\min(|x|, |y|)/m \\in [0, 1]$:"
msgstr "直接计算 $\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}$ 时，当 $|x| > 1.34 \\times 10^{154}$ 会上溢，尽管 $|z|$ 本身可以表示；对极小的输入则会下溢。取 $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$，$t = \\min(|x|, |y|)/m \\in [0, 1]$："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:165
msgid "`abs` delegates to `hypot`, which uses this kind of scaling; `abs_log` uses the second form, so $\\ln|z|$ is finite for every finite non-zero $z$; and `abs_sqr` uses the third, which only overflows when $|z|^2$ itself does."
msgstr "`abs` 委托给使用此类缩放的 `hypot`；`abs_log` 使用第二种形式，因此对每个有限非零的 $z$，$\\ln|z|$ 都是有限的；`abs_sqr` 使用第三种形式，只有当 $|z|^2$ 本身上溢时才会上溢。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:169
msgid "Stable square root"
msgstr "稳定的平方根"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:171
msgid "The textbook formulas"
msgstr "教科书公式"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:178
msgid "cancel catastrophically: for $x > 0$ and $|y| \\ll x$, $|z| - x$ loses all digits, and for $x < 0$, $|z| + x$ does. The package computes only the cancellation-free quantity"
msgstr "会发生灾难性相消：当 $x > 0$ 且 $|y| \\ll x$ 时，$|z| - x$ 丢失全部有效数字；当 $x < 0$ 时，$|z| + x$ 亦然。本包只计算无相消的量"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:190
msgid "where the scaled forms avoid overflow, and recovers the other part from $\\operatorname{Re}\\sqrt z \\cdot \\operatorname{Im}\\sqrt z = y/2$. For $x \\ge 0$ the root is $w + \\frac{y}{2w}i$; indeed, with $w^2 = (x + |z|)/2$,"
msgstr "其中缩放形式避免了上溢，再由 $\\operatorname{Re}\\sqrt z \\cdot \\operatorname{Im}\\sqrt z = y/2$ 求出另一部分。当 $x \\ge 0$ 时，根为 $w + \\frac{y}{2w}i$；事实上，由 $w^2 = (x + |z|)/2$，"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:200
msgid "For $x < 0$ the root is $\\frac{|y|}{2w} \\pm wi$ with the sign of $y$, by the same computation with $|x|$. The real part is never negative, as the principal branch requires. On the cut, $y = -0$ is treated like $y = +0$, so both sides map to $+\\sqrt{|x|}\\,i$."
msgstr "当 $x < 0$ 时，按同样的计算（用 $|x|$）可得根为 $\\frac{|y|}{2w} \\pm wi$，符号与 $y$ 相同。实部永不为负，符合主分支的要求。在割线上，$y = -0$ 与 $y = +0$ 同样处理，因此两侧都映射到 $+\\sqrt{|x|}\\,i$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:205
msgid "Smith's division"
msgstr "Smith 除法"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:207
msgid "The textbook quotient divides by $c^2 + d^2$, with the overflow problems of the [core design](core.md#textbook-division-in-the-generic-core). Smith's method divides by the larger component first.[^smith] For $|c| \\ge |d|$ let $r = d/c$, so $|r| \\le 1$:"
msgstr "教科书式商要除以 $c^2 + d^2$，存在[核心设计](core.md#textbook-division-in-the-generic-core)中所述的上溢问题。Smith 方法先除以较大的分量。[^smith] 当 $|c| \\ge |d|$ 时，令 $r = d/c$，于是 $|r| \\le 1$："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:219
msgid "and symmetrically with $r = c/d$ when $|d| > |c|$. Only $r^2 \\le 1$ is squared, so $1 \\le 1 + r^2 \\le 2$ never overflows. `div` computes the reciprocal $s = 1/c$ once and returns"
msgstr "当 $|d| > |c|$ 时对称地取 $r = c/d$。只有 $r^2 \\le 1$ 被平方，因此 $1 \\le 1 + r^2 \\le 2$ 永远不会上溢。`div` 只计算一次倒数 $s = 1/c$，并返回"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:227
msgid "which avoids forming $c(1 + r^2)$, a product that could overflow for $|c| > \\Omega/2$, where $\\Omega \\approx 1.8 \\times 10^{308}$ is the largest finite `Double`. The reciprocal has its own limits: for $|c| < 1/\\Omega \\approx 5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$ it overflows to $\\infty$, and the result becomes NaN even when the quotient is finite (the [API](../api/float_backend.md#div) gives an example); for $|c| > 2^{1022}$ it is subnormal and loses a few bits. Dividing $a$ and $b$ by $c$ directly, instead of multiplying them by $s$, would avoid both."
msgstr "这样避免了形成 $c(1 + r^2)$——当 $|c| > \\Omega/2$ 时这个乘积可能上溢，其中 $\\Omega \\approx 1.8 \\times 10^{308}$ 是最大的有限 `Double`。倒数本身也有界限：$|c| < 1/\\Omega \\approx 5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$ 时它上溢为 $\\infty$，即使商是有限的，结果也变成 NaN（[API](../api/float_backend.md#div) 给出了一个例子）；$|c| > 2^{1022}$ 时它是次正规数，会丢失几位精度。直接用 $c$ 去除 $a$ 和 $b$，而不是乘以 $s$，可以同时避免这两个问题。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:236
msgid "If $w$ has an infinite part and $z$ has no NaN part, `div` replaces every part of $w$ by its infinity sign ($\\pm 1$, or $0$ for a finite part). A finite numerator then gives zero parts, as C99 Annex G requires. An infinite numerator gives the quotient of the sign patterns, so $\\infty/\\infty = 1$, where C99 returns NaN."
msgstr "若 $w$ 有无穷分量而 $z$ 没有 NaN 分量，`div` 把 $w$ 的每个分量替换为它的无穷符号（$\\pm 1$，有限分量则为 $0$）。这样有限的分子得到零分量，符合 C99 附录 G 的要求。无穷的分子得到符号模式之商，因此 $\\infty/\\infty = 1$，而 C99 返回 NaN。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:242
msgid "R. L. Smith, \"Algorithm 116: Complex division\", *Communications of the ACM* 5(8), 1962."
msgstr "R. L. Smith, \"Algorithm 116: Complex division\", *Communications of the ACM* 5(8), 1962."

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:245
msgid "Exact integer powers"
msgstr "精确的整数幂"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:247
msgid "$z^n$ through $e^{n\\operatorname{Log} z}$ rounds the angle $n\\theta$ and the modulus $e^{n\\ln|z|}$, so even $(1 + i)^2$ would not come out as exactly $2i$. For a real integer exponent with $|n| \\le 2^{31} - 1$, `pow` and `pow_real` use binary powering instead: $O(\\log |n|)$ complex multiplications, exact for small Gaussian integers, and $z^{-n} = (z^{-1})^n$. Other exponents use the polar form of $e^{w\\operatorname{Log} z}$: with $\\ell = \\ln|z|$ from `abs_log` and $\\theta = \\arg z$,"
msgstr "通过 $e^{n\\operatorname{Log} z}$ 计算 $z^n$ 会对角度 $n\\theta$ 和模 $e^{n\\ln|z|}$ 进行舍入，因此即使 $(1 + i)^2$ 也不会精确得到 $2i$。对于满足 $|n| \\le 2^{31} - 1$ 的实整数指数，`pow` 和 `pow_real` 改用二进制快速幂：$O(\\log |n|)$ 次复数乘法，对小的高斯整数是精确的，且 $z^{-n} = (z^{-1})^n$。其他指数使用 $e^{w\\operatorname{Log} z}$ 的极坐标形式：取 `abs_log` 给出的 $\\ell = \\ln|z|$ 和 $\\theta = \\arg z$，"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:260
msgid "At $z = 0$, $0^0 = 1$, $0^w = 0$ for real $w > 0$, and every other exponent gives NaN."
msgstr "在 $z = 0$ 处，$0^0 = 1$，对实数 $w > 0$ 有 $0^w = 0$，其他所有指数都得到 NaN。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:263
msgid "Overflow-free tangent"
msgstr "不会上溢的正切"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:265
msgid "$\\tan(x + iy) = \\dfrac{\\sin 2x + i\\sinh 2y}{\\cos 2x + \\cosh 2y}$, using $\\cos^2 x + \\sinh^2 y = \\frac12(\\cos 2x + \\cosh 2y)$. For large $|y|$ both $\\sinh 2y$ and $\\cosh 2y$ overflow while $\\tan z \\to \\pm i$. Multiplying numerator and denominator by $2d$ with $d = e^{-2|y|}$, and using $2d\\cosh 2y = 1 + d^2$, $2d\\sinh 2y = \\operatorname{sign}(y)(1 - d^2)$:"
msgstr "利用 $\\cos^2 x + \\sinh^2 y = \\frac12(\\cos 2x + \\cosh 2y)$，有 $\\tan(x + iy) = \\dfrac{\\sin 2x + i\\sinh 2y}{\\cos 2x + \\cosh 2y}$。当 $|y|$ 很大时，$\\sinh 2y$ 和 $\\cosh 2y$ 都会上溢，而 $\\tan z \\to \\pm i$。将分子分母同乘以 $2d$（$d = e^{-2|y|}$），并利用 $2d\\cosh 2y = 1 + d^2$、$2d\\sinh 2y = \\operatorname{sign}(y)(1 - d^2)$："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:275
msgid "`tan` uses this form for $|y| \\ge 1$ and the direct form below, where it is accurate. `tanh` applies the same derivation with the roles of $x$ and $y$ exchanged."
msgstr "`tan` 在 $|y| \\ge 1$ 时使用这一形式，在其下方使用精度足够的直接形式。`tanh` 采用相同的推导，只是交换 $x$ 与 $y$ 的角色。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:279
msgid "The arcsine algorithm of Hull, Fairgrieve and Tang"
msgstr "Hull、Fairgrieve 与 Tang 的反正弦算法"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:281
msgid "For $x, y \\ge 0$, let $r = |z + 1|$, $s = |z - 1|$, $A = \\frac{r + s}{2} \\ge 1$ and $B = x/A \\le 1$. Then[^hft]"
msgstr "对 $x, y \\ge 0$，令 $r = |z + 1|$，$s = |z - 1|$，$A = \\frac{r + s}{2} \\ge 1$，$B = x/A \\le 1$。则[^hft]"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:290
msgid "and the other quadrants follow from oddness in each part. Both formulas lose accuracy in two regions, which the algorithm treats separately:"
msgstr "其他象限可由各分量的奇性得出。这两个公式在两个区域会损失精度，算法对它们分别处理："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:293
msgid "When $B$ is close to $1$ ($B > 0.6417$), $\\arcsin B$ is ill-conditioned. The real part is computed as $\\arctan(x/\\sqrt D)$ with a quantity $D$ formed from $r + x + 1$ and $s \\pm (1 - x)$ without subtraction."
msgstr "当 $B$ 接近 $1$（$B > 0.6417$）时，$\\arcsin B$ 是病态的。此时实部按 $\\arctan(x/\\sqrt D)$ 计算，其中量 $D$ 由 $r + x + 1$ 和 $s \\pm (1 - x)$ 构成，不涉及减法。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:296
msgid "When $A$ is close to $1$ ($A \\le 1.5$), $\\ln(A + \\sqrt{A^2 - 1})$ suffers from $A^2 - 1$. The algorithm computes $A - 1$ without cancellation from $y^2/(r + x + 1)$ and $s \\pm (1 - x)$ and uses $\\operatorname{log1p}\\big((A - 1) + \\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}\\big)$."
msgstr "当 $A$ 接近 $1$（$A \\le 1.5$）时，$\\ln(A + \\sqrt{A^2 - 1})$ 受 $A^2 - 1$ 影响。算法由 $y^2/(r + x + 1)$ 和 $s \\pm (1 - x)$ 无相消地计算 $A - 1$，并使用 $\\operatorname{log1p}\\big((A - 1) + \\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}\\big)$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:301
msgid "For $|x|$ or $|y|$ above $10^{150}$, where $r$ and $s$ would overflow, `asin` uses the asymptotic form $\\operatorname{asin} z \\approx \\operatorname{atan2}(x, y) + i(\\ln 2 + \\ln|z|)$. To derive it for $x, y \\ge 0$, note that the leading terms of $iz + \\sqrt{1 - z^2}$ cancel, because $\\sqrt{1 - z^2} \\approx -iz$ there. Use instead"
msgstr "当 $|x|$ 或 $|y|$ 超过 $10^{150}$ 时，$r$ 和 $s$ 会上溢，此时 `asin` 使用渐近形式 $\\operatorname{asin} z \\approx \\operatorname{atan2}(x, y) + i(\\ln 2 + \\ln|z|)$。为在 $x, y \\ge 0$ 时推导它，注意 $iz + \\sqrt{1 - z^2}$ 的首项会相消，因为那里 $\\sqrt{1 - z^2} \\approx -iz$。改用"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:313
msgid "Then $\\operatorname{Log}\\frac{i}{2z} = -\\ln(2|z|) + i\\big(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - \\arg z\\big)$, and multiplying by $-i$ gives"
msgstr "于是 $\\operatorname{Log}\\frac{i}{2z} = -\\ln(2|z|) + i\\big(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2} - \\arg z\\big)$，乘以 $-i$ 得到"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:321
msgid "using $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{atan2}(y, x) = \\operatorname{atan2}(x, y)$ in the first quadrant. For $|z| > 10^{150}$ the neglected term is below $10^{-300}$. `acos` uses $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$ there, which gives the principal value in every quadrant."
msgstr "这里用到了第一象限中的 $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{atan2}(y, x) = \\operatorname{atan2}(x, y)$。当 $|z| > 10^{150}$ 时，被忽略的项小于 $10^{-300}$。在该区域 `acos` 使用 $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$，在每个象限都给出主值。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:326
msgid "T. E. Hull, T. F. Fairgrieve and P. T. P. Tang, \"Implementing the complex arcsine and arccosine functions using exception handling\", *ACM Transactions on Mathematical Software* 23(3), 1997. The crossover values $1.5$ and $0.6417$ are theirs."
msgstr "T. E. Hull, T. F. Fairgrieve and P. T. P. Tang, \"Implementing the complex arcsine and arccosine functions using exception handling\", *ACM Transactions on Mathematical Software* 23(3), 1997. 分界值 $1.5$ 和 $0.6417$ 取自该文。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:331
msgid "Arctangent and inverse hyperbolic tangent"
msgstr "反正切与反双曲正切"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:333
msgid "Writing $q = (1 + iz)/(1 - iz)$ with $z = x + iy$:"
msgstr "记 $q = (1 + iz)/(1 - iz)$，其中 $z = x + iy$："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:341
msgid "and $\\operatorname{atan} z = \\frac{1}{2i}\\operatorname{Log} q$ gives"
msgstr "由 $\\operatorname{atan} z = \\frac{1}{2i}\\operatorname{Log} q$ 得"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:348
msgid "The ratio inside the logarithm equals $(1 + u)/(1 - u)$ with $u = 2y/(1 + |z|^2)$; for $|u| < 0.1$ the package evaluates it as $\\operatorname{log1p}(u) - \\operatorname{log1p}(-u)$ to keep accuracy near the real axis. For large $|z|$ the real part is evaluated on $x/m, y/m$ with $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$. `atanh` is the same computation with $x$ and $y$ exchanged, from $\\operatorname{atanh} z = -i\\operatorname{atan}(iz)$, and switches to $\\operatorname{log1p}$ when $|4x/((1 - x)^2 + y^2)| < 1/4$."
msgstr "对数内的比值等于 $(1 + u)/(1 - u)$，其中 $u = 2y/(1 + |z|^2)$；当 $|u| < 0.1$ 时，本包将其按 $\\operatorname{log1p}(u) - \\operatorname{log1p}(-u)$ 求值，以保持实轴附近的精度。当 $|z|$ 很大时，实部在 $x/m, y/m$ 上求值，其中 $m = \\max(|x|, |y|)$。由 $\\operatorname{atanh} z = -i\\operatorname{atan}(iz)$，`atanh` 是交换 $x$ 与 $y$ 后的相同计算，并在 $|4x/((1 - x)^2 + y^2)| < 1/4$ 时切换到 $\\operatorname{log1p}$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:356
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic cosine by Kahan's formula"
msgstr "基于 Kahan 公式的反双曲余弦"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:358
msgid "`acosh` uses $2\\operatorname{Log}\\big(\\sqrt{(z + 1)/2} + \\sqrt{(z - 1)/2}\\big)$, built from the stable square root. Unlike $\\operatorname{Log}(z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1})$, it has the correct cut $(-\\infty, 1)$ without extra sign adjustments. The first root has its cut on $(-\\infty, -1)$ and the second on $(-\\infty, 1)$, so together they cut exactly $(-\\infty, 1)$. The logarithm adds no cut of its own: both principal roots have a non-negative real part, so their sum $S$ has $\\operatorname{Re} S \\ge 0$ and never lies on $(-\\infty, 0]$ unless $S = 0$, which would need $(z + 1)/2 = (z - 1)/2 = 0$. The identity itself follows from squaring: $S^2 = z + 2\\sqrt{(z+1)/2}\\sqrt{(z-1)/2}$, so $S^2 = z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1}$ for the branch of $\\sqrt{z^2 - 1}$ that this product selects, and $2\\operatorname{Log} S = \\operatorname{Log} S^2$ because $|\\arg S| \\le \\pi/2$."
msgstr "`acosh` 使用 $2\\operatorname{Log}\\big(\\sqrt{(z + 1)/2} + \\sqrt{(z - 1)/2}\\big)$，由稳定的平方根构成。与 $\\operatorname{Log}(z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1})$ 不同，它无需额外的符号调整就有正确的割线 $(-\\infty, 1)$。第一个根的割线在 $(-\\infty, -1)$，第二个根的割线在 $(-\\infty, 1)$，合起来恰好是 $(-\\infty, 1)$。对数不会引入自己的割线：两个主平方根的实部都非负，所以它们的和 $S$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Re} S \\ge 0$，除非 $S = 0$ 否则不会落在 $(-\\infty, 0]$ 上，而 $S = 0$ 要求 $(z + 1)/2 = (z - 1)/2 = 0$。恒等式本身由平方得到：$S^2 = z + 2\\sqrt{(z+1)/2}\\sqrt{(z-1)/2}$，因此对该乘积所选定的 $\\sqrt{z^2 - 1}$ 分支有 $S^2 = z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1}$；又因为 $|\\arg S| \\le \\pi/2$，所以 $2\\operatorname{Log} S = \\operatorname{Log} S^2$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:372
msgid "Exact real fast paths"
msgstr "精确的实数快速路径"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:374
msgid "`sin` and `cos` return the real function for $y = 0$ exactly; `asin`, `acos`, `asinh`, `acosh` and `atanh` dispatch real inputs to the `_real` functions and purely imaginary inputs to the real inverse functions of $y$. This keeps results on the real line exactly real, and the `_real` functions also serve callers who start from a `Double`."
msgstr "`sin` 和 `cos` 在 $y = 0$ 严格成立时返回实函数值；`asin`、`acos`、`asinh`、`acosh` 和 `atanh` 将实数输入分派给 `_real` 函数，将纯虚数输入分派给关于 $y$ 的实反函数。这使实轴上的结果保持为精确的实数，且 `_real` 函数也可供从 `Double` 出发的调用者使用。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:380
msgid "Reciprocal functions through the core inverse"
msgstr "通过核心逆元实现的倒数类函数"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:382
msgid "`sec`, `csc`, `cot`, their hyperbolic counterparts and the inverse reciprocal functions are compositions with `Complex::inv` of the [core](core.md#floating-point-instances). They inherit its unscaled formula and its limits, instead of producing infinities at poles: an abort when the modulus of the argument is below about $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ (which in practice happens at $0$ for `csc`, `cot`, `csch`, `coth` and the inverse reciprocal functions), infinite or NaN parts for moduli below about $10^{-154}$, and NaN parts for moduli above about $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$. The other poles, such as $\\pi/2$ for `sec`, are not representable exactly, and the computed $\\cos$ there is about $6 \\times 10^{-17}$, so `sec` returns a large finite value. `acot` special-cases $z = 0$ to return $\\pi/2$."
msgstr "`sec`、`csc`、`cot`、它们的双曲对应函数以及反倒数类函数都是与[核心包](core.md#floating-point-instances) `Complex::inv` 的复合。它们继承其未缩放公式及其界限，而不是在极点处给出无穷大：参数的模低于约 $1.5 \\times 10^{-162}$ 时中止（实际上对 `csc`、`cot`、`csch`、`coth` 和反倒数类函数发生在 $0$ 处），模低于约 $10^{-154}$ 时得到无穷或 NaN 分量，模高于约 $1.3 \\times 10^{154}$ 时得到 NaN 分量。其他极点，例如 `sec` 的 $\\pi/2$，无法精确表示，那里计算出的 $\\cos$ 约为 $6 \\times 10^{-17}$，因此 `sec` 返回一个很大的有限值。`acot` 对 $z = 0$ 做特殊处理，返回 $\\pi/2$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:396
msgid "Identities checked by the test suite"
msgstr "测试套件检查的恒等式"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:398
msgid "`exp(log z) = z`, `sin(asin z) = z`, `cos(acos z) = z`, `tan(atan z) = z`, `sinh(asinh z) = z` and `tanh(atanh z) = z` at sample points in the first quadrant, with tolerances $10^{-10}$ to $10^{-12}$; `sqrt(-3 + 4i) = 1 + 2i`; regressions for huge `asin` arguments, the `atan` cut, infinite `atanh` and `acosh` inputs, division by infinity and $0^0$, $0^{-1}$."
msgstr "在第一象限的采样点上检查 `exp(log z) = z`、`sin(asin z) = z`、`cos(acos z) = z`、`tan(atan z) = z`、`sinh(asinh z) = z` 和 `tanh(atanh z) = z`，容差为 $10^{-10}$ 至 $10^{-12}$；`sqrt(-3 + 4i) = 1 + 2i`；以及针对超大 `asin` 参数、`atan` 割线、无穷 `atanh` 与 `acosh` 输入、除以无穷大以及 $0^0$、$0^{-1}$ 的回归测试。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:404
msgid "Values on the branch cuts"
msgstr "分支切割线上的取值"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:406
msgid "A function is discontinuous across its cut, so the value on the cut has to agree with one side. With signed zeros a library can let the sign of a zero part pick the side (C99 Annex G does). This package ignores the sign of zero: it tests `y == 0.0` or `x == 0.0` and sends exact real or imaginary inputs to fast paths. The value on each cut therefore matches one fixed side, measured by comparing $f(p)$ with $f(p \\pm 10^{-9} i)$ (real-axis cuts) or $f(p \\pm 10^{-9})$ (imaginary-axis cuts):"
msgstr "函数在割线两侧不连续，因此割线上的值必须与某一侧一致。借助带符号的零，库可以让零分量的符号来选择哪一侧（C99 附录 G 就是这样）。本包忽略零的符号：它用 `y == 0.0` 或 `x == 0.0` 判断，并把恰为实数或纯虚数的输入送往快速路径。因此每条割线上的值都固定地与某一侧一致；下表通过比较 $f(p)$ 与 $f(p \\pm 10^{-9} i)$（实轴上的割线）或 $f(p \\pm 10^{-9})$（虚轴上的割线）测得："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:414
msgid "Cut"
msgstr "割线"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:414
msgid "Value on the cut matches"
msgstr "割线上的值与之一致的一侧"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:416
msgid "the upper side ($y > 0$)"
msgstr "上侧（$y > 0$）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:417
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:418
msgid "$x > 1$ and $x < -1$"
msgstr "$x > 1$ 与 $x < -1$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:417
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:418
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:419
msgid "the upper side"
msgstr "上侧"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:420
msgid "the right side ($x > 0$)"
msgstr "右侧（$x > 0$）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:421
msgid "the left side ($x < 0$)"
msgstr "左侧（$x < 0$）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:422
msgid "$x < 0$, resp. $x < -1$ for `acosh`"
msgstr "$x < 0$；对 `acosh` 为 $x < -1$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:422
msgid "neither side (the $2\\pi$ defect below)"
msgstr "两侧都不一致（见下面的 $2\\pi$ 缺陷）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:424
msgid "The real-axis cuts thus behave like C99 with $y = +0$. On the imaginary-axis cuts `atan` and `asinh` attach the upper cut to the right half-plane and the lower cut to the left one. That keeps them odd on the cuts ($f(-z) = -f(z)$), but differs from C99 with $x = +0$ on the lower cut: C99 gives `casinh(+0 - 2i)` $= 1.317 - i\\pi/2$, this package $-1.317 - i\\pi/2$."
msgstr "因此实轴上的割线表现得像取 $y = +0$ 的 C99。在虚轴上的割线上，`atan` 和 `asinh` 把上方割线接到右半平面，把下方割线接到左半平面。这使它们在割线上保持奇函数性质（$f(-z) = -f(z)$），但在下方割线上与取 $x = +0$ 的 C99 不同：C99 给出 `casinh(+0 - 2i)` $= 1.317 - i\\pi/2$，本包给出 $-1.317 - i\\pi/2$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:431
msgid "Known deviations from the principal values"
msgstr "与主值的已知偏差"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:433
msgid "The implementation uses the constant $2\\pi$ (`tau`) in places where the principal value needs $\\pi$:"
msgstr "实现在主值需要 $\\pi$ 的地方使用了常量 $2\\pi$（`tau`）："

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:436
msgid "Function and input"
msgstr "函数与输入"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:436
msgid "Returned"
msgstr "返回值"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:436
msgid "Principal value"
msgstr "主值"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:438
msgid "$\\pi$ (C99: $\\pm\\pi$ by the sign of $y$)"
msgstr "$\\pi$（C99：按 $y$ 的符号取 $\\pm\\pi$）"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:439
msgid "`log(z)`, same inputs"
msgstr "`log(z)`，输入同上"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:440
msgid "`pow`, `pow_real`, negative real base, non-integer exponent"
msgstr "`pow`、`pow_real`，负实数底数，非整数指数"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:440
msgid "angle $2\\pi$"
msgstr "角度 $2\\pi$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:440
msgid "angle $\\pi$"
msgstr "角度 $\\pi$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:444
msgid "`acosh_real(x)` and `acosh(x + 0i)`, $x < -1$"
msgstr "`acosh_real(x)` 和 `acosh(x + 0i)`，$x < -1$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:445
msgid "`asec(z)`, $\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$ except real $z \\le -1$"
msgstr "`asec(z)`，$\\operatorname{Re} z < 0$，实数 $z \\le -1$ 除外"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:445
msgid "through `acos`: real part $+\\pi$"
msgstr "经由 `acos`：实部多出 $\\pi$"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:445
#: manual/design/float_backend.md:447
msgid "principal"
msgstr "主值"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:447
msgid "through `log`"
msgstr "经由 `log`"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:449
msgid "Because $e^{2\\pi i} = 1$ while $e^{\\pi i} = -1$, these values are not even logarithms or inverses of the input: `exp(log(-1))` is $1$, and `cos(acos(z))` is $-z$ for $x < 0$. For powers the error is a rotation by $e^{i\\pi w}$: $(-4)^{1/2}$ comes out as $2e^{i\\pi} = -2$ instead of $2i$, and $(-8)^{1/3}$ as $2e^{2\\pi i/3} = -1 + 1.732i$ instead of $1 + 1.732i$. Only the mid-range branch of `acos` is affected: for a part above $10^{150}$, `acos` uses $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$ and returns the principal value, so its real part jumps by $\\pi$ at that threshold. The test suite currently asserts the $2\\pi$ value of `arg` on the negative axis. These are defects to be fixed in the implementation; this manual records the current behaviour."
msgstr "由于 $e^{2\\pi i} = 1$ 而 $e^{\\pi i} = -1$，这些值甚至不是输入的对数或反函数值：`exp(log(-1))` 为 $1$，并且当 $x < 0$ 时 `cos(acos(z))` 为 $-z$。对幂而言，误差是乘上一个旋转 $e^{i\\pi w}$：$(-4)^{1/2}$ 得到 $2e^{i\\pi} = -2$ 而不是 $2i$，$(-8)^{1/3}$ 得到 $2e^{2\\pi i/3} = -1 + 1.732i$ 而不是 $1 + 1.732i$。只有 `acos` 的中间范围分支受影响：某一分量超过 $10^{150}$ 时，`acos` 使用 $\\pi/2 - \\operatorname{asin} z$ 并返回主值，因此其实部在该阈值处跳变 $\\pi$。测试套件目前断言的是负实轴上 `arg` 的 $2\\pi$ 值。这些是有待在实现中修复的缺陷；本手册记录的是当前行为。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:461
msgid "Other accuracy notes"
msgstr "其他精度说明"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:463
msgid "`asin` evaluates $\\sqrt{A^2 - 1}$ in its $A \\le 1.5$ branch where the Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang algorithm (and `acos` here) uses $\\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}$. Close to the branch points $\\pm1$ this loses digits: at $1 + 10^{-10}i$ the imaginary part has a relative error near $4 \\times 10^{-8}$."
msgstr "`asin` 在 $A \\le 1.5$ 分支中计算 $\\sqrt{A^2 - 1}$，而 Hull–Fairgrieve–Tang 算法（以及这里的 `acos`）使用 $\\sqrt{(A - 1)(A + 1)}$。在分支点 $\\pm1$ 附近这会丢失有效数字：在 $1 + 10^{-10}i$ 处，虚部的相对误差接近 $4 \\times 10^{-8}$。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:468
msgid "`exp` overflows in $e^x$ before multiplying by $\\cos y$ and $\\sin y$, so `exp(710 + 0i)` has a NaN imaginary part ($\\infty \\cdot 0$). `sin`, `cos`, `sinh` and `cosh` have the same product structure: `sin(800i)` has a NaN real part, `cosh(800 + 0i)` and `sinh(800 + 0i)` a NaN imaginary part. Testing for an exactly zero factor before multiplying would give the C99 values."
msgstr "`exp` 在乘以 $\\cos y$ 和 $\\sin y$ 之前就在 $e^x$ 处上溢，因此 `exp(710 + 0i)` 的虚部为 NaN（$\\infty \\cdot 0$）。`sin`、`cos`、`sinh` 和 `cosh` 具有同样的乘积结构：`sin(800i)` 的实部为 NaN，`cosh(800 + 0i)` 和 `sinh(800 + 0i)` 的虚部为 NaN。在相乘前检查恰为零的因子，就能得到 C99 的值。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:474
msgid "`abs_log` evaluates $\\tfrac12\\ln(1 + t^2)$ with `ln`, not `log1p`. For $t^2$ below the unit roundoff, $1 + t^2$ rounds to $1$ and the term vanishes, so the relative error of $\\ln|z|$ is large when $|z|$ is close to $1$: `abs_log(1 + 1e-10i)` is $0$ instead of $5 \\times 10^{-21}$. The absolute error stays below about $10^{-16}$."
msgstr "`abs_log` 用 `ln` 而不是 `log1p` 计算 $\\tfrac12\\ln(1 + t^2)$。当 $t^2$ 低于单位舍入误差时，$1 + t^2$ 舍入为 $1$，该项消失，因此 $|z|$ 接近 $1$ 时 $\\ln|z|$ 的相对误差很大：`abs_log(1 + 1e-10i)` 为 $0$ 而不是 $5 \\times 10^{-21}$。绝对误差保持在约 $10^{-16}$ 以下。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:479
msgid "`div` multiplies by $1/c$, which overflows for a subnormal $c$; see [Smith's division](#smiths-division)."
msgstr "`div` 乘以 $1/c$，而 $c$ 为次正规数时它会上溢；见 [Smith 除法](#smiths-division)。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:481
msgid "The trait method `FloatingSpecialValues::is_negative_zero` is `is_neg_inf(1.0 / x)` without a test for zero, so it is also true for negative subnormal numbers whose reciprocal overflows. The package's own functions use a private helper that tests `x == 0.0` first."
msgstr "trait 方法 `FloatingSpecialValues::is_negative_zero` 是不带零检查的 `is_neg_inf(1.0 / x)`，因此对倒数上溢的负次正规数也为真。本包自己的函数使用一个先检查 `x == 0.0` 的私有辅助函数。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:485
msgid "The `Float` instance of `log1p` is $\\ln(1 + x)$, which loses relative accuracy for $|x| \\ll 1$ and returns $0$ below about $6 \\times 10^{-8}$; no public function uses it yet."
msgstr "`log1p` 的 `Float` 实例为 $\\ln(1 + x)$，当 $|x| \\ll 1$ 时会损失相对精度，低于约 $6 \\times 10^{-8}$ 时返回 $0$；目前还没有公开函数使用它。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:488
msgid "`asec_real` and `acsc_real` have no NaN check, so a NaN argument gives a finite real part ($2\\pi$, resp. $-\\pi/2$) with a NaN imaginary part."
msgstr "`asec_real` 和 `acsc_real` 没有 NaN 检查，因此 NaN 参数会得到有限的实部（分别为 $2\\pi$ 和 $-\\pi/2$）和 NaN 虚部。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:493
msgid "**Methods on `Complex`.** Not possible from a separate package, and moving the functions into the core would bring IEEE semantics into the generic type."
msgstr "**`Complex` 上的方法。** 在独立的包中无法做到，而把这些函数移入核心又会把 IEEE 语义带入泛型类型。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:496
msgid "**A single floating-real trait.** It would force IEEE special values on every analytic scalar."
msgstr "**单一的浮点实数 trait。** 这会把 IEEE 特殊值强加给每个解析标量。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:498
msgid "**Textbook formulas everywhere.** Simpler, but they overflow for $|z| \\gtrsim 10^{154}$ and cancel near the branch cuts, as derived above."
msgstr "**处处使用教科书公式。** 更简单，但如上文推导所示，它们在 $|z| \\gtrsim 10^{154}$ 时上溢，并在分支切割线附近发生相消。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:500
msgid "**Full C99 Annex G special-value tables.** Only the cases listed in the API are handled; the remaining infinities and NaN propagate through ordinary arithmetic."
msgstr "**完整的 C99 附录 G 特殊值表。** 只处理 API 中列出的情形；其余的无穷大和 NaN 通过普通算术传播。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:506
msgid "Analytic functions for `Complex[Double]` only; no `Complex[Float]` functions, although the traits are implemented for `Float`."
msgstr "仅为 `Complex[Double]` 提供解析函数；虽然这些 trait 已为 `Float` 实现，但没有 `Complex[Float]` 函数。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:508
msgid "No signed-zero selection of the side of a branch cut; `arg` also returns the same value for $y = +0$ and $y = -0$."
msgstr "不通过带符号的零来选择分支切割线的哪一侧；`arg` 对 $y = +0$ 和 $y = -0$ 也返回相同的值。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:510
msgid "Reciprocal functions abort at poles instead of returning infinities."
msgstr "倒数类函数在极点处中止，而不是返回无穷大。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:511
msgid "No error bounds are certified; accuracy is checked by regression tests."
msgstr "不提供经过认证的误差界；精度由回归测试检查。"

#: manual/design/float_backend.md:512
msgid "No checked or contextual (`Result`) variants."
msgstr "没有带检查或带上下文（`Result`）的变体。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "luna-complex"
msgstr "luna-complex"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This manual documents the code of `Luna-Flow/luna-complex` at version `0.2.0` (the version in `moon.mod`) on MoonBit 0.10, including the unreleased changes listed in [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md)."
msgstr "本手册记录 `Luna-Flow/luna-complex` 在 MoonBit 0.10 上 `0.2.0` 版本（即 `moon.mod` 中的版本）的代码，包括 [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md) 中列出的尚未发布的改动。"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-complex` provides complex numbers for Luna Flow. The root package defines the generic type `Complex[T]`, the ring $T[i]/(i^2 + 1)$ over any scalar `T`, with its arithmetic and `luna-generic` structure instances. The `float_backend` package adds the analytic functions of `Complex[Double]` (roots, logarithms, powers, trigonometric and hyperbolic functions and their inverses) with numerically stable formulas, and the capability traits for floating-point scalars."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-complex` 为 Luna Flow 提供复数。根包定义了泛型类型 `Complex[T]`，即任意标量 `T` 上的环 $T[i]/(i^2 + 1)$，以及其算术运算和 `luna-generic` 结构实例。`float_backend` 包添加了 `Complex[Double]` 的解析函数（开方、对数、幂、三角函数与双曲函数及其反函数），采用数值稳定的公式，并提供浮点标量的能力 trait。"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "[!WARNING] On the negative real axis `arg` returns $2\\pi$ instead of $\\pi$, so `log(-1)` is $2\\pi i$, `pow_real(-4 + 0i, 0.5)` is $-2$ instead of $2i$, and `acos`, `acosh` and the functions built on them return values off by $\\pi$ for some negative inputs. The [float_backend design](design/float_backend.md#known-deviations-from-the-principal-values) lists every affected case."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 在负实轴上，`arg` 返回 $2\\pi$ 而不是 $\\pi$，因此 `log(-1)` 为 $2\\pi i$，`pow_real(-4 + 0i, 0.5)` 为 $-2$ 而不是 $2i$，并且 `acos`、`acosh` 以及建立在它们之上的函数对某些负输入返回的值相差 $\\pi$。[float_backend 设计](design/float_backend.md#known-deviations-from-the-principal-values)列出了所有受影响的情形。"

