#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:1
msgid "float_backend tutorial"
msgstr "float_backend 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:3
msgid "This tutorial computes with the analytic functions of `Complex[Double]`. You will convert between Cartesian and polar form, take roots and logarithms, solve a quadratic equation, evaluate trigonometric functions and their inverses, and learn where the branch cuts are. The formulas and their numerical treatment are in the [float_backend design](../design/float_backend.md). Every example is a test that you can paste into a `_test.mbt` file and run with `moon test`; the expected output is written in the `inspect` calls."
msgstr "本教程使用 `Complex[Double]` 的解析函数进行计算。你将在直角坐标形式与极坐标形式之间转换，求根和对数，解二次方程，计算三角函数及其反函数，并了解分支切割线的位置。公式及其数值处理见 [float_backend 设计](../design/float_backend.md)。每个示例都是一个测试，可以粘贴到 `_test.mbt` 文件中用 `moon test` 运行；期望的输出写在 `inspect` 调用中。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:13
msgid "get the modulus or the angle"
msgstr "求模或角度"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:14
msgid "divide safely, also with huge or tiny values"
msgstr "安全地做除法，包括很大或很小的值"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:15
msgid "take a square root or a logarithm"
msgstr "求平方根或对数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:16
msgid "raise to a power"
msgstr "求幂"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:17
msgid "evaluate sine, cosine, tangent and their inverses"
msgstr "计算正弦、余弦、正切及其反函数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:18
msgid "start from a real number outside the real domain"
msgstr "从实数定义域之外的实数出发"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:19
msgid "write helpers generic over `Float` and `Double`"
msgstr "编写对 `Float` 和 `Double` 泛型的辅助函数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:27
msgid "Import both packages in the `moon.pkg` of the package that uses them:"
msgstr "在使用它们的包的 `moon.pkg` 中导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:36
msgid "The smallest useful program applies three functions to one number:"
msgstr "最小的有用程序对一个数应用三个函数："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:62
msgid "Solve a quadratic equation"
msgstr "解二次方程"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:64
msgid "The roots of $az^2 + bz + c$ are $(-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac})/(2a)$. With `sqrt` and `div` the formula works for complex coefficients and negative discriminants:"
msgstr "$az^2 + bz + c$ 的根为 $(-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac})/(2a)$。借助 `sqrt` 和 `div`，该公式适用于复系数和负判别式："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:82
msgid "Logarithms and powers"
msgstr "对数与幂"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:94
msgid "$i^i = e^{i \\cdot i\\pi/2} = e^{-\\pi/2}$ is real. Integer exponents use exact binary powering, so $i^2$ is exactly $-1$."
msgstr "$i^i = e^{i \\cdot i\\pi/2} = e^{-\\pi/2}$ 是实数。整数指数使用精确的二进制快速幂，因此 $i^2$ 恰好为 $-1$。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:97
msgid "Do not take non-integer powers of negative real numbers yet. `arg` returns $2\\pi$ instead of $\\pi$ on the negative real axis, so the angle of the result is wrong:"
msgstr "暂时不要对负实数取非整数次幂。`arg` 在负实轴上返回 $2\\pi$ 而不是 $\\pi$，因此结果的角度是错的："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:111
msgid "Use `sqrt` for square roots, and for other exponents compute $|z|^p e^{i\\pi p}$ yourself until the defect is fixed."
msgstr "平方根请使用 `sqrt`；在缺陷修复之前，其他指数请自行计算 $|z|^p e^{i\\pi p}$。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:114
msgid "Trigonometric functions and their inverses"
msgstr "三角函数及其反函数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:126
msgid "`asin_real` takes a `Double` and returns a complex result outside $[-1, 1]$."
msgstr "`asin_real` 接受一个 `Double`，在 $[-1, 1]$ 之外返回复数结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:129
msgid "Large arguments"
msgstr "大参数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:131
msgid "The formulas are scaled, so huge or tiny inputs do not overflow:"
msgstr "这些公式经过缩放，因此极大或极小的输入都不会上溢："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:148
msgid "Multi-valued functions jump across their branch cuts. `sqrt` has its cut on the negative real axis; approaching it from above and below gives roots of opposite sign:"
msgstr "多值函数在跨越分支切割线时会跳变。`sqrt` 的割线位于负实轴；从上方和下方逼近它会得到符号相反的根："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:161
msgid "On the cut itself the root is $+2i$, also for a negative zero imaginary part: the functions do not look at the sign of a zero. The [design](../design/float_backend.md#principal-values-of-the-other-functions) lists the cuts of every function."
msgstr "在割线上，根为 $+2i$，虚部为负零时也是如此：这些函数不看零的符号。[设计文档](../design/float_backend.md#principal-values-of-the-other-functions)列出了每个函数的割线。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:165
msgid "Writing scalar-generic helpers"
msgstr "编写标量泛型的辅助函数"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:167
msgid "The capability traits let helpers state what they need from a real scalar. For example, a function that only inspects special values asks for `FloatingSpecialValues` and works for `Float` and `Double`:"
msgstr "借助能力 trait，辅助函数可以声明它对实数标量的需求。例如，一个只检查特殊值的函数只要求 `FloatingSpecialValues`，便可同时适用于 `Float` 和 `Double`："

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:184
msgid "`is_negative_zero` is also true for tiny negative subnormal numbers such as `-1.0e-310`; test `x == 0.0` first when you need exactly $-0$."
msgstr "对于 `-1.0e-310` 这样很小的负次正规数，`is_negative_zero` 也为真；需要恰好判断 $-0$ 时，请先检查 `x == 0.0`。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:189
msgid "**The negative real axis.** `arg` and `log` currently return $2\\pi$ instead of $\\pi$ there (`log(-1)` is $2\\pi i$, and `exp(log(-1))` is $1$), and powers of negative real numbers with non-integer exponents inherit that angle; `acos`, `acos_real`, `asec`, `asec_real`, `acosh`, `acosh_real` and `asech` are affected for some negative inputs. See the warning in the [float_backend API](../api/float_backend.md#conventions)."
msgstr "**负实轴。** `arg` 和 `log` 目前在负实轴上返回 $2\\pi$ 而非 $\\pi$（`log(-1)` 为 $2\\pi i$，`exp(log(-1))` 为 $1$），负实数的非整数次幂也继承了这一角度；`acos`、`acos_real`、`asec`、`asec_real`、`acosh`、`acosh_real` 和 `asech` 对某些负输入也受影响。参见 [float_backend API](../api/float_backend.md#conventions) 中的警告。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:195
msgid "**Reciprocal functions abort near zero.** `cot(0)`, `csc(0)`, `asec(0)`, `pow_real(z, -2.0)` for a tiny $z$ and the like stop the program instead of returning infinity, because they go through the core `inv`."
msgstr "**倒数类函数在零附近中止。** `cot(0)`、`csc(0)`、`asec(0)`、对很小的 $z$ 求 `pow_real(z, -2.0)` 等会终止程序，而不是返回无穷大，因为它们经由核心包的 `inv`。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:199
msgid "**Use `@fb.div`, not `/`, for extreme values.** The core operator forms $c^2 + d^2$ and aborts if it underflows to zero. `@fb.div` itself returns NaN when the divisor is a subnormal number below about $5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$."
msgstr "**对极端值使用 `@fb.div` 而非 `/`。** 核心运算符会计算 $c^2 + d^2$，若其下溢为零则中止。`@fb.div` 本身在除数是低于约 $5.6 \\times 10^{-309}$ 的次正规数时返回 NaN。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:203
msgid "**`exp` overflows early.** `exp(z)` for $\\operatorname{Re} z > 709.78$ has infinite or NaN parts; `sin`, `cos`, `sinh` and `cosh` produce NaN parts in the same way for arguments beyond about $710$."
msgstr "**`exp` 过早上溢。** 当 $\\operatorname{Re} z > 709.78$ 时，`exp(z)` 含有无穷或 NaN 分量；`sin`、`cos`、`sinh` 和 `cosh` 对超过约 $710$ 的参数也会以同样方式产生 NaN 分量。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:206
msgid "**Only `Complex[Double]`.** The analytic functions do not accept `Complex[Float]`."
msgstr "**仅支持 `Complex[Double]`。** 解析函数不接受 `Complex[Float]`。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:211
msgid "The [float_backend API](../api/float_backend.md) documents every function and its special cases."
msgstr "[float_backend API](../api/float_backend.md) 记录了每个函数及其特殊情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:213
msgid "The [float_backend design](../design/float_backend.md) derives the stable formulas and lists the known deviations."
msgstr "[float_backend 设计](../design/float_backend.md)推导了稳定公式，并列出了已知偏差。"

#: manual/tutorial/float_backend.md:215
msgid "The [core tutorial](core.md) covers the generic arithmetic."
msgstr "[核心教程](core.md)介绍泛型算术运算。"

#~ msgid "It computes $n = c^2 + d^2$, then `Inverse::inv(n)`, and multiplies both parts of $z\\bar w$ by it. The formula is not scaled: for `Double`, $c^2 + d^2$ overflows for $|w| \\gtrsim 10^{154}$ and underflows for $|w| \\lesssim 10^{-162}$, and `Inverse::inv` of `Double` aborts with `Double::inv: division by zero` when $n$ is zero, including after underflow. Use [`@fb.div`](float_backend.md#div) for robust floating-point division."
#~ msgstr "它先计算 $n = c^2 + d^2$，再计算 `Inverse::inv(n)`，并用它乘以 $z\\bar w$ 的两个部分。该公式未做缩放：对于 `Double`，当 $|w| \\gtrsim 10^{154}$ 时 $c^2 + d^2$ 上溢，当 $|w| \\lesssim 10^{-162}$ 时下溢；而当 $n$ 为零（包括下溢导致为零）时，`Double` 的 `Inverse::inv` 会以 `Double::inv: division by zero` 中止。稳健的浮点除法请使用 [`@fb.div`](float_backend.md#div)。"

#~ msgid "**Special values.** NaN and infinities are handled where stated (`div`, `atan`, `atanh`, `acosh`, `abs_log`, `pow`); elsewhere they propagate through ordinary `Double` arithmetic and may produce NaN parts."
#~ msgstr "**特殊值。** NaN 和无穷大仅在注明之处（`div`、`atan`、`atanh`、`acosh`、`abs_log`、`pow`）做专门处理；其他地方它们通过普通 `Double` 算术传播，可能产生 NaN 分量。"

#~ msgid "**Reciprocal functions abort at poles.** `sec`, `csc`, `cot`, `sech`, `csch`, `coth`, `asec`, `acsc`, `asech`, `acsch`, `acoth` and the exponent $-1$ of `pow` use `Complex::inv`, which aborts with `Double::inv: division by zero` on a zero modulus."
#~ msgstr "**倒数类函数在极点处中止。** `sec`、`csc`、`cot`、`sech`、`csch`、`coth`、`asec`、`acsc`、`asech`、`acsch`、`acoth` 以及 `pow` 的指数 $-1$ 都使用 `Complex::inv`，它在模为零时以 `Double::inv: division by zero` 中止。"

#~ msgid "It is finite for every finite non-zero $z$, even when $|z|$ itself would overflow. `abs_log(0)` is $-\\infty$."
#~ msgstr "对每个有限非零的 $z$，结果都是有限的，即使 $|z|$ 本身会上溢。`abs_log(0)` 为 $-\\infty$。"

#~ msgid "`z.inv()` (aborts if $z = 0$, which the first rows exclude)"
#~ msgstr "`z.inv()`（$z = 0$ 时中止，但前面几行已排除该情况）"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\cos z$; aborts where $\\cos z = 0$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\cos z$；在 $\\cos z = 0$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\sin z$; aborts at $z = k\\pi$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\sin z$；在 $z = k\\pi$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\tan z$; aborts at $z = k\\pi$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\tan z$；在 $z = k\\pi$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{acos}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\cosh z$; aborts where $\\cosh z = 0$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\cosh z$；在 $\\cosh z = 0$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\sinh z$; aborts at $z = k\\pi i$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\sinh z$；在 $z = k\\pi i$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $1/\\tanh z$; aborts at $z = k\\pi i$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $1/\\tanh z$；在 $z = k\\pi i$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "Returns $\\operatorname{acosh}(1/z)$; aborts at $z = 0$."
#~ msgstr "返回 $\\operatorname{acosh}(1/z)$；在 $z = 0$ 处中止。"

#~ msgid "As a quotient of a commutative ring, $R[i]$ is a commutative ring, with zero $0 + 0i$ and one $1 + 0i$; $R$ embeds as $a \\mapsto a + 0i$."
#~ msgstr "作为交换环的商，$R[i]$ 是交换环，零元为 $0 + 0i$，单位元为 $1 + 0i$；$R$ 通过 $a \\mapsto a + 0i$ 嵌入其中。"

#~ msgid "and symmetrically with $r = c/d$ when $|d| > |c|$. Only $r^2 \\le 1$ is squared, so the denominator overflows only if the quotient does. `div` computes $1/c$ once and multiplies by it. If $w$ has an infinite part and $z$ has no NaN part, `div` follows C99 Annex G: a finite numerator gives a zero result, and an infinite one the quotient of the infinity signs."
#~ msgstr "当 $|d| > |c|$ 时，对称地取 $r = c/d$。只有 $r^2 \\le 1$ 被平方，因此分母仅在商本身上溢时才会上溢。`div` 只计算一次 $1/c$ 再与之相乘。若 $w$ 有无穷分量而 $z$ 没有 NaN 分量，`div` 遵循 C99 附录 G：有限的分子得到零结果，无穷的分子得到无穷大符号之商。"

#~ msgid "`acosh` uses $2\\operatorname{Log}\\big(\\sqrt{(z + 1)/2} + \\sqrt{(z - 1)/2}\\big)$, built from the stable square root. Unlike $\\operatorname{Log}(z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1})$, it has the correct cut $(-\\infty, 1)$ without extra sign adjustments, because each square root has its cut where its argument is negative real."
#~ msgstr "`acosh` 使用 $2\\operatorname{Log}\\big(\\sqrt{(z + 1)/2} + \\sqrt{(z - 1)/2}\\big)$，由稳定的平方根构成。与 $\\operatorname{Log}(z + \\sqrt{z^2 - 1})$ 不同，它无需额外的符号调整就具有正确的割线 $(-\\infty, 1)$，因为每个平方根的割线都位于其参数为负实数之处。"

#~ msgid "`sec`, `csc`, `cot`, their hyperbolic counterparts and the inverse reciprocal functions are compositions with `Complex::inv` of the [core](core.md). They inherit its unscaled formula and its abort on a zero modulus, instead of producing infinities at poles. `acot` special-cases $z = 0$ to return $\\pi/2$."
#~ msgstr "`sec`、`csc`、`cot`、它们的双曲对应函数以及反倒数类函数都是与[核心](core.md)的 `Complex::inv` 的复合。它们继承了其未缩放的公式以及在模为零时中止的行为，而不是在极点处产生无穷大。`acot` 对 $z = 0$ 做特殊处理，返回 $\\pi/2$。"

#~ msgid "`exp` overflows in $e^x$ before multiplying by $\\cos y$ and $\\sin y$, so `exp(710 + 0i)` has a NaN imaginary part ($\\infty \\cdot 0$)."
#~ msgstr "`exp` 在乘以 $\\cos y$ 和 $\\sin y$ 之前就在 $e^x$ 处上溢，因此 `exp(710 + 0i)` 的虚部为 NaN（$\\infty \\cdot 0$）。"

