#~ msgid "`luna-complex` provides a generic `Complex[T]` core for algebraic complex arithmetic in LunaFlow, with floating analytic and transcendental helpers split into the `Luna-Flow/luna-complex/float_backend` backend package. This manual describes version 0.3.0."
#~ msgstr "`luna-complex` 为 LunaFlow 提供用于代数复数运算的泛型 `Complex[T]` 核心，浮点解析函数与超越函数辅助则拆分到 `Luna-Flow/luna-complex/float_backend` 后端包中。本手册描述 0.3.0 版本。"

#~ msgid "Source"
#~ msgstr "源码"

#~ msgid "Contents"
#~ msgstr "内容"

#~ msgid "The generic `Complex[T]` type, its trait implementations, and basic algebraic operations."
#~ msgstr "泛型 `Complex[T]` 类型、它的 trait 实现以及基本代数运算。"

#~ msgid "Floating backend traits plus `Complex[Double]` functions such as `polar`, `arg`, `abs`, `sqrt`, `log`, `sin`, `cos`, `asin`, `acosh`, and `atanh`."
#~ msgstr "浮点后端 trait，以及 `Complex[Double]` 函数，例如 `polar`、`arg`、`abs`、`sqrt`、`log`、`sin`、`cos`、`asin`、`acosh` 和 `atanh`。"

#~ msgid "`Complex[T]` is a mutable struct with explicit `re` / `im` fields for in-place updates when desired. Besides `Complex::new`, it provides `set`, `set_re`, and `set_im`. Under the matching constraints on `T`, it implements the `luna-generic` algebra traits from `Zero` and `AddMonoid` up to `Ring` and `Field`, together with `Conjugate`, `Inverse`, the arithmetic operators, `Eq`, and `Show`. Because the constraints are traits rather than a fixed scalar type, values can nest, as in `Complex[Complex[Double]]`."
#~ msgstr "`Complex[T]` 是一个可变结构体，带有显式的 `re` / `im` 字段，需要时可以原地更新。除 `Complex::new` 外，它还提供 `set`、`set_re` 和 `set_im`。在 `T` 满足相应约束时，它实现从 `Zero`、`AddMonoid` 直到 `Ring`、`Field` 的 `luna-generic` 代数 trait，以及 `Conjugate`、`Inverse`、算术运算符、`Eq` 和 `Show`。由于约束是 trait 而不是固定的标量类型，值可以嵌套，例如 `Complex[Complex[Double]]`。"

#~ msgid "`float_backend` covers the elementary functions (`exp`, `log`, `log_10`, `log_b`, `pow`, `pow_real`, `sqrt`), the trigonometric and hyperbolic functions with their inverses, and real-argument variants such as `sqrt_real`, `asin_real`, and `acosh_real`. It relies on `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` for the elementary-function capability surface and keeps its floating backend traits, IEEE special-value handling, and numeric-stability logic inside the package."
#~ msgstr "`float_backend` 涵盖初等函数（`exp`、`log`、`log_10`、`log_b`、`pow`、`pow_real`、`sqrt`）、三角函数与双曲函数及其反函数，以及 `sqrt_real`、`asin_real`、`acosh_real` 等实数参数版本。它依赖 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 提供初等函数能力，并把浮点后端 trait、IEEE 特殊值处理和数值稳定性逻辑保留在包内部。"

#~ msgid "Use `float_backend` when a `Complex[Double]` value needs analytic or transcendental functions."
#~ msgstr "当 `Complex[Double]` 需要解析函数或超越函数时使用 `float_backend`。"

#~ msgid "Design notes"
#~ msgstr "设计说明"

#~ msgid "The analytic functions are free functions, such as `@float_backend.log(z)` and `@float_backend.sin(z)`, not methods. MoonBit does not allow a subpackage to add methods or trait implementations to a type defined in another package, so `float_backend` cannot attach them to `Complex[T]`. Restoring method-style transcendental APIs would require moving those definitions back into the root package or introducing a different wrapper design."
#~ msgstr "解析函数是自由函数，例如 `@float_backend.log(z)` 和 `@float_backend.sin(z)`，而不是方法。MoonBit 不允许子包为其他包中定义的类型添加方法或 trait 实现，因此 `float_backend` 无法把它们挂到 `Complex[T]` 上。若要恢复方法风格的超越函数 API，需要把这些定义移回根包，或采用另一种包装设计。"

#~ msgid "The split is intentional: it keeps floating arithmetic, IEEE special values, and branch-cut behavior out of the root package's generic algebraic semantics."
#~ msgstr "这种拆分是有意为之：它把浮点运算、IEEE 特殊值和分支切割行为排除在根包的泛型代数语义之外。"

#~ msgid "Each package has an API reference ([core](api/core.md), [float_backend](api/float_backend.md)), a tutorial ([core](tutorial/core.md), [float_backend](tutorial/float_backend.md)), and a design note ([core](design/core.md), [float_backend](design/float_backend.md))."
#~ msgstr "每个包都有 API 参考（[core](api/core.md)、[float_backend](api/float_backend.md)）、教程（[core](tutorial/core.md)、[float_backend](tutorial/float_backend.md)）和设计说明（[core](design/core.md)、[float_backend](design/float_backend.md)）。"

#~ msgid "The generated interface files `src/pkg.generated.mbti` and `src/float_backend/pkg.generated.mbti` list every public signature, and the package documentation on [mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io/docs/Luna-Flow/luna-complex) renders them. To work on the library, read the [contribution guidelines](contributing.md)."
#~ msgstr "生成的接口文件 `src/pkg.generated.mbti` 和 `src/float_backend/pkg.generated.mbti` 列出了全部公开签名，[mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io/docs/Luna-Flow/luna-complex) 上的包文档会渲染这些接口。如需参与本库的开发，请阅读[贡献规范](contributing.md)。"

#~ msgid "Use the root package when you need generic complex construction and algebraic operations."
#~ msgstr "需要泛型复数构造和代数运算时使用根包。"

#~ msgid "Suggested flow"
#~ msgstr "建议流程"

#~ msgid "Import the root package and bring `Complex` into scope."
#~ msgstr "导入根包并引入 `Complex`。"

#~ msgid "Construct values with `Complex::new(re, im)`."
#~ msgstr "使用 `Complex::new(re, im)` 构造复数。"

#~ msgid "Use algebraic operators when the scalar type implements the required Luna Flow traits."
#~ msgstr "当标量类型实现所需 Luna Flow trait 时，直接使用代数运算符。"

#~ msgid "Practical guidance"
#~ msgstr "实用建议"

#~ msgid "Use `Complex[Double]` for ordinary floating-point values and `Complex[Complex[Double]]` when nested algebraic behavior is useful."
#~ msgstr "普通浮点复数使用 `Complex[Double]`；需要嵌套代数行为时可以使用 `Complex[Complex[Double]]`。"

#~ msgid "Use `set`, `set_re`, and `set_im` only when mutation is intended."
#~ msgstr "只有确实需要原地更新时才使用 `set`、`set_re` 和 `set_im`。"

#~ msgid "Use `float_backend` for transcendental and branch-sensitive floating behavior."
#~ msgstr "超越函数和分支敏感的浮点行为使用 `float_backend`。"

#~ msgid "Import `Complex` from the root package or through `float_backend`."
#~ msgstr "从根包或 `float_backend` 引入 `Complex`。"

#~ msgid "Construct a `Complex[Double]` value."
#~ msgstr "构造一个 `Complex[Double]`。"

#~ msgid "Call free functions such as `@float_backend.log(z)`, `@float_backend.sin(z)`, or `@float_backend.sqrt(z)`."
#~ msgstr "调用自由函数，例如 `@float_backend.log(z)`、`@float_backend.sin(z)` 或 `@float_backend.sqrt(z)`。"

#~ msgid "Prefer the free functions in this package over duplicating formulas downstream."
#~ msgstr "优先使用本包的自由函数，不要在下游重复实现公式。"

#~ msgid "Treat branch-sensitive functions such as `arg`, `log`, `sqrt`, and inverse trigonometric functions as part of this package's observable contract."
#~ msgstr "`arg`、`log`、`sqrt` 和反三角函数等分支敏感函数属于本包的可观察契约。"

#~ msgid "Use the backend traits only when writing new floating backend code."
#~ msgstr "只有在编写新的浮点后端代码时才直接使用后端 trait。"

#~ msgid "Use this subsystem when you need logarithmic, trigonometric, or hyperbolic helpers specialized for `Complex[Double]`."
#~ msgstr "当你需要专门针对 `Complex[Double]` 的对数、三角或双曲函数时，使用这个子包。"

#~ msgid "The split is intentional: once real-function and transcendental trait constraints exist, they can replace the `Double` extension layer without changing the generic core."
#~ msgstr "这种拆分是有意为之：一旦有了实函数与超越函数的 trait 约束，就可以用它们替换 `Double` 扩展层，而无需改动泛型核心。"
